Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个简单的故事\N{\fs14}This is a simple story...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不易说\N{\fs14}but not an easy one to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.81,0:00:45.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像寓言  有悲有喜\N{\fs14}Like a fable, there is sorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也像寓言  让人不可思议\N{\fs14}and, like a fable, it is full of wonder and happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:54.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1939年  意大利中部
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.51,0:00:56.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我唱我所见  没有什么能逃过我的双眼\N{\fs14}I sing what I see. Nothing gets by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.59,0:00:58.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对混乱说  我在这儿\N{\fs14}"Here I am," said I to chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.41,0:01:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的奴隶  混沌赞  好\N{\fs14}"I am your slave!" And he: "Good."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.95,0:01:02.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  用不着你赞好\N{\fs14}"For what?" said I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我终于自由  比起我的喜悦...\N{\fs14}Free in the end, I am! What good is a caress when bliss...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的赞好  算是什么\N{\fs14}this man came to possess?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经准备好\N{\fs14}Here I am, ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像火车般飞驰  然而刹掣不管用\N{\fs14}The trains are gone, the brakes are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:18.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也无法抵抗  迷人的酒神啊  带上我\N{\fs14}And I can resist no more. Go, sweet Bacchus, take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:21.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刹闸不管用  刹闸不管用\N{\fs14}The brakes are gone! The brakes are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:22.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到了\N{\fs14}I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.60,0:01:25.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-刹闸失灵了  -踩下去\N{\fs14}- No, they're really gone! - Hit the brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你在念诗\N{\fs14}Weren't you reciting a poem?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:30.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汽车刹不住\N{\fs14}It doesn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.54,0:01:36.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刹车\N{\fs14}Brake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:41.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们死定了  树林\N{\fs14}We're going to die! The woods!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.93,0:01:47.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刹车\N{\fs14}Brake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.06,0:01:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国王驾到\N{\fs14}The king is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:57.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国王来了\N{\fs14}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.69,0:02:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面人潮涌动  直驶\N{\fs14}It's full of people down there. Straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.49,0:02:03.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刹闸没了\N{\fs14}We have no brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有刹闸  挪开\N{\fs14}We have no brakes! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:25.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美丽人生\N{\fs14}LIFE IS BEAUTIFUL
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.73,0:02:35.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去走动走动\N{\fs14}Go for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则明天也到不了\N{\fs14}Otherwise, we'll get there tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.82,0:02:40.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到螺丝了\N{\fs14}I found the screw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.91,0:02:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在需要什么\N{\fs14}Now what do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没别的  只要让我清静10分钟\N{\fs14}Nothing. I need ten minutes alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:49.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行  我走开\N{\fs14}All right, I'll leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要刚才的螺丝吗\N{\fs14}Do you want the screw from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:54.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要  只要你走开\N{\fs14}No, I just want to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.90,0:03:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果找到了颗螺丝  我应该扔掉吗\N{\fs14}Do I toss out the screw if I find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.72,0:03:10.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让我一个人待10分钟吧\N{\fs14}I need ten minutes alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.95,0:03:14.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我去洗洗手\N{\fs14}I'm washing my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姑娘  你好\N{\fs14}Pretty girl! How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.01,0:03:26.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在干什么\N{\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些东西是你妈妈的吗\N{\fs14}Did your mom put this stuff here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  是女房东的\N{\fs14}No, the landlady did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.51,0:03:35.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在摆卖吗  好极了\N{\fs14}Is it a market? It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.18,0:03:37.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个多少钱  你多大了\N{\fs14}How much is it? How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:39.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是我问的太多了  你叫什么\N{\fs14}I ask too many questions. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Eleonora \N{\fs14}Eleonora.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:43.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸会  我是Guido王子\N{\fs14}Nice to meet you. I'm Prince Guido.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:44.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是王子\N{\fs14}Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的是王子哦\N{\fs14}I'm a prince, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:48.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一带的土地...\N{\fs14}All the land...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:49.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是本王子的\N{\fs14}all this is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是本王子的封邑\N{\fs14}Here starts the prince's principate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:55.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要叫它Addis Ababa\N{\fs14}I'll call this place Addis Ababa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.75,0:03:58.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打算用骆驼取代牛\N{\fs14}I'll change it all. Out go the cows, in come the camels.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:01.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骆驼\N{\fs14}Camels?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.17,0:04:03.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至引进几头河马\N{\fs14}Even a few hippopotamus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:05.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了  跟公主有约\N{\fs14}I must go. I'm meeting with the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:07.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么时候  -现在\N{\fs14}- When? - Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.65,0:04:14.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安  公主\N{\fs14}Good morning, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.23,0:04:18.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓死我了  差点没摔死  有没有压伤你\N{\fs14}How frightening. I almost killed myself. Did I hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没啥大事\N{\fs14}I've never been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.45,0:04:21.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一向都飞身下楼\N{\fs14}Do you always leave the house like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想烧黄蜂巢  却被蜇了\N{\fs14}I wanted to burn that wasps' nest, but I got stung.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被蜇了  我给你吸吸\N{\fs14}A wasp stung you? There? Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要动  公主\N{\fs14}Hold still, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.09,0:04:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黄蜂毒得狠\N{\fs14}A wasp's poison is very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要把毒液啜出来才行\N{\fs14}You have to get it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-躺下  过会儿就没事了  -谢谢\N{\fs14}- Lie down. It'll take a while. - No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:42.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还有哪被蜇了  -没了\N{\fs14}- Did you get stung anywhere else? - No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.31,0:04:45.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好美的景色啊\N{\fs14}What a place here! It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.15,0:04:49.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸽子畅游天际  女人从天而降  我一定要搬来\N{\fs14}Pigeons fly, women fall from the sky. I'm moving here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:52.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是这里的王子  他会在这里养满骆驼\N{\fs14}It's all his! He wants to fill it with camels! He's a prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.74,0:04:54.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fs14}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.24,0:04:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公主  Guido王子有礼了\N{\fs14}Prince Guido at your service, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来了\N{\fs14}I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.62,0:05:02.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了\N{\fs14}Goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.71,0:05:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎样谢你\N{\fs14}How can I thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.75,0:05:05.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用多谢\N{\fs14}There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:08.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真想谢的话...\N{\fs14}If you really want to thank me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.76,0:05:11.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赏几只蛋来  给我的武士吃\N{\fs14}I'll take some eggs to make a nice omelet for my squire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便拿  不要客气\N{\fs14}Take whatever you want. It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fs14}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拿两...六个吧  我来煎个蛋饼\N{\fs14}I'll take two... six. All right? I'll make a nice omelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.48,0:05:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜  Eleonora  致以诚挚的问候  公主\N{\fs14}Goodbye, Eleonora! My regards, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.49,0:05:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后会有期\N{\fs14}Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nuvolari  今晚我们有蛋饼吃\N{\fs14}Here I am, Nuvolari! Tonight's special: omelet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.29,0:05:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一带好多骆驼\N{\fs14}All camels here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-哪间屋呢  -转左  快到了\N{\fs14}- Where is this house? - Turn left. We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.35,0:05:48.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叔叔也跟我们一起住\N{\fs14}Is your uncle sleeping with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.31,0:05:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是酒店的头儿  在酒店都住了30年了\N{\fs14}He's lived in the hotel for 30 years. He's the headman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.64,0:05:54.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那间屋子本是他的储藏室  借给我们用的\N{\fs14}He's lending us the house. He uses it for storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:56.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到了\N{\fs14}There. We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我叔叔的马  叫罗宾汉\N{\fs14}That's Robin Hood, my uncle's horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是他的马车还有他的房子\N{\fs14}Here's my uncle's buggy and my uncle's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:05.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屋里的那位就是我叔叔了\N{\fs14}And inside is my uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:08.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叔叔  我们来了  快点  已经很晚了\N{\fs14}Hello, dear uncle! Here we are! Hurry, it's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.33,0:06:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汽车途中抛锚了\N{\fs14}Here we are. The car broke down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叔叔\N{\fs14}Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:24.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-野蛮人  -他们是谁\N{\fs14}- Barbarians. - Who were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.89,0:06:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-只是野蛮人而已  -为何不呼救\N{\fs14}- Barbarians. - Why didn't you cry for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.06,0:06:30.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此时无声胜有声\N{\fs14}Silence is the most powerful cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.15,0:06:31.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的诗人朋友\N{\fs14}Is he your poet friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.74,0:06:34.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫Ferruccio  是搞装修的\N{\fs14}My name is Ferruccio. I'm also an upholsterer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.03,0:06:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这儿  一件旧货仓  地方狭窄  里面堆满了杂物\N{\fs14}Here you are. It's an old storehouse full of odds and ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:42.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢收藏杂物\N{\fs14}An old passion; an odd and end in itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.29,0:06:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收藏来有什么用\N{\fs14}What's all this stuff for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要住多久都可以  我可没空陪你们\N{\fs14}You can stay as long as you want. It's not easy to be a waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那张床  据说一位革命家睡过\N{\fs14}That's the bed. Legend has it Garibaldi slept there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.97,0:06:55.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么比非必需品更必需\N{\fs14}Nothing is more necessary than the unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.51,0:06:56.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,野蛮人\N{\fs14}Barbarians.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:07:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,市政局在Sestani街  大堂右边\N{\fs14}The town hall is on Via Sestani, to the right after the colonnade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是浴室  设备略有新意\N{\fs14}The bathroom, equipped with the invention of Mr. Bidet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有几本书  诗人传记之类的\N{\fs14}There are a few books here, among which The Life of Petrarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:12.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厨房在这里  脚踏车  也就是单车\N{\fs14}The kitchen is in there. This is a velocipede, commonly called a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回酒店了  钥匙只有一把  别弄丢了\N{\fs14}I have to get back to the hotel. There's only one key. Don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.29,0:07:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎你们的到来  罗宾汉  等等我\N{\fs14}It's so good to see you. I'm coming, Robin Hood!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走  罗宾汉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.22,0:07:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的叔叔很特别\N{\fs14}What an uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:31.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个城市多美丽\N{\fs14}Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没介绍错吧  到了这儿  想做什么就做什么\N{\fs14}Didn't I tell you? We're in a city. You can do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.98,0:07:38.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  无拘无束  想做就做\N{\fs14}If you want to do something, you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:42.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想放松吗  想大喊吗  喊吧\N{\fs14}You want to let yourself go? You want to yell? Yell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:47.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别喊了  发什么神经\N{\fs14}Stop it! What are you, crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.49,0:07:50.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是市里  不是乡下\N{\fs14}You can't act like you do in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.79,0:07:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可以大呼小叫\N{\fs14}You've been yelling like a madman. You can't yell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.30,0:07:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉  钥匙\N{\fs14}Mary! The key!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.97,0:08:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了吧  不可以吵嚷\N{\fs14}See? You can't yell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:06.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该整天吟诗\N{\fs14}Understand? If you stopped thinking so much about poetry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.31,0:08:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该去赚赚钱  令你爸爸放心\N{\fs14}you'd make your father happier and you'd make more money than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  Oreste  我正那样劝他\N{\fs14}That's right, Oreste. That's what I tell him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该踏实一点\N{\fs14}You have to settle down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:16.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好漂亮的帽子  好看吗\N{\fs14}What a nice hat. How does it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.53,0:08:20.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真棒  好看吗  -好看是好看  不过这帽子是我的\N{\fs14}- Nice. How does it look? - Nice, but it's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.37,0:08:22.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我几时开工\N{\fs14}When do I start working?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经迟到了  赶紧开始吧\N{\fs14}You're already late. Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.87,0:08:27.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将那椅子搬入工作间\N{\fs14}Get that armchair and take it to the workshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:31.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那张吗  -对  小心\N{\fs14}- That one? - That one. And be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去市政局  再见\N{\fs14}Good. I'm going to the town hall. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:37.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见  记得规规矩矩\N{\fs14}Goodbye, and behave yourselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:39.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在时势险恶\N{\fs14}because these are hard times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:42.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是么\N{\fs14}Hard, hard times!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时势险恶\N{\fs14}They're hard times?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:47.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为啥呀  你有什么高见\N{\fs14}Why, what are your political views?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:49.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Benito  Adolph  老实点\N{\fs14}Benito! Adolph! Be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说啥了\N{\fs14}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:56.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  你有什么看法\N{\fs14}I said, how are things going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:08:58.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么再见了\N{\fs14}Goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:09:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心  别撞断椅腿\N{\fs14}Careful! You'll break the legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.09,0:09:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fs14}Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.97,0:09:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他偷了我的帽子  我不会放过他的\N{\fs14}He pulled it off. He took my hat. I'll find him though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.81,0:09:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Benito  信不信我赏你一耳光\N{\fs14}Benito, you're going to get a slap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:22.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,申请书店营业的手续很繁复\N{\fs14}I need to do the whole bureaucratic procedure to open a bookstore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.57,0:09:24.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-时间很长吗  -得好几年\N{\fs14}- Does it take a long time? - Years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:27.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就现在填写申请表吧\N{\fs14}Then we'd better open a file now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.83,0:09:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先填妥申请表  交给政务官签名\N{\fs14}First you apply, and the department head has to sign it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.62,0:09:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同时...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.75,0:09:37.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差点压碎了鸡蛋  昨天才得到的呢\N{\fs14}I almost scrambled my eggs. I've had them since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.63,0:09:40.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都忘了  幸好没有破裂  你写下来\N{\fs14}I forgot about them. Thank God they didn't break. Take note.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.09,0:09:42.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本人Guido Orefice兹申请...\N{\fs14}I, the undersigned, Guido Orefice...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.85,0:09:45.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,政务官现在没空签名\N{\fs14}- am applying to open… - He can't sign it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.39,0:09:48.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fs14}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.89,0:09:51.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想请你签个名  我要开书店\N{\fs14}I need your signature to open a bookstore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-小姐，发生了什么事  - Rodolfo先生  我告诉过他\N{\fs14}- Miss, what's going on? - Mr. Rodolfo, I told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.03,0:09:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-只签一个名  -不签\N{\fs14}- Just one signature. - No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.61,0:10:00.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有人接替我一小时  问他吧\N{\fs14}My substitute will be here in an hour. Ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-就签一下吧  -我们一点休息\N{\fs14}- All I need is a signature. - We close at one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在还有10分钟\N{\fs14}It's ten to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.17,0:10:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不服气  尽管投诉\N{\fs14}File a complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真黑心  他只要签个名  填份资料\N{\fs14}Boy, is he nasty. To sign a paper, open a file, 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:15.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就可以立即递申请表\N{\fs14}all he had to do was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.97,0:10:18.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却硬要我等一个钟头\N{\fs14}Now I have to wait one hour for his substitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要投诉  写下来  本人Guido...\N{\fs14}I'm filing a complaint. Write, "I, the undersigned..."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:26.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\fs14}What a wallop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有伤到  我帮你\N{\fs14}Are you hurt? I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.95,0:10:34.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是故意的\N{\fs14}Come here. I didn't do it on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碰我\N{\fs14}Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以后休想开书店\N{\fs14}You can forget about your bookshop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:42.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要戴  有蛋\N{\fs14}No, the eggs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子  我要杀了你\N{\fs14}You scoundrel! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.31,0:10:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让开\N{\fs14}Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.70,0:11:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安  公主\N{\fs14}Good morning, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:12.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能够站着见面就好\N{\fs14}I wonder if we'll ever bump into each other standing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.16,0:11:15.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我赶时间\N{\fs14}Excuse me, but I've got to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.71,0:11:17.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见  公主\N{\fs14}Farewell, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.73,0:11:33.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-鸡肉  -没问题\N{\fs14}- Chicken. - That's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.48,0:11:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上整只的  鸡屁股向下\N{\fs14}It's served whole, bottom down on the plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.53,0:11:38.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-可以替我切吗  -当然\N{\fs14}"Will you cut it for me?" "Naturally."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我抓稳  一刀向鸡膀下捅进去\N{\fs14}I stick the blade under the wing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.91,0:11:43.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将鸡腿扯掉\N{\fs14}then I rip off the drumstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后起鸡胸肉\N{\fs14}I cut the meat along the bottom of the breastbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:47.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-扯掉鸡翅  切掉鸡胸 扒掉鸡皮\N{\fs14}- Off go the wings, breast and skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙虾\N{\fs14}Lobster
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.13,0:11:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,易如反掌\N{\fs14}Piece of cake, Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一刀向虾翼下捅进去...\N{\fs14}I stick the wing under the leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:56.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起虾腿  扭龙虾  一刀...\N{\fs14}Off goes the leg. I rip off the lobster, stick the...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:12:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙虾是甲壳类动物\N{\fs14}Lobster is a crustacean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这甲壳类动物...\N{\fs14}Off goes the crust...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起虾壳\N{\fs14}of the crustacean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:09.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起虾须  虾须吃不得吧\N{\fs14}Off go the crust and antennae. Who eats the antennae?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:12.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去掉虾须  去掉龙虾\N{\fs14}Off go the antennae, off goes the lobster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:14.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,片甲不留\N{\fs14}There's nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.07,0:12:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有龙虾  但有色香味美的鸡\N{\fs14}We're out of lobster, but the chicken is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.66,0:12:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了怎样上龙虾\N{\fs14}I don't remember how to do lobster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:23.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接从厨房捧出来\N{\fs14}You serve it as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.33,0:12:24.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连碰也不用碰\N{\fs14}There's no need to touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:28.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真容易  难怪我没记住\N{\fs14}That's too easy. That's why I didn't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.47,0:12:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-继续啊  -老实点\N{\fs14}- Continue. - Behavior!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在桌旁站定  像这样\N{\fs14}Stand by. Still, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:33.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-服务员  -在\N{\fs14}"Waiter?" "Yes?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.85,0:12:37.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站定  候命  服务员\N{\fs14}In position. Stand by behavior. Waiter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么专叫我  怎不叫其他人\N{\fs14}Why only me? There must be other waiters, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鞠躬  难到哪去\N{\fs14}Bowing! Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:56.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鞠得再低些\N{\fs14}You bow down, further.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:13:00.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这个香槟瓶  45度\N{\fs14}Like this, at a 45 degree angle, just like a champagne bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,45度  甚至50度  55度\N{\fs14}45 degrees, even 50, 55.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,90度  直角  180度\N{\fs14}90 degrees. A right angle. 180.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还得鞠多低  180度  像这样吗\N{\fs14}How far do I bow down? 180 degrees? Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:13.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学向日葵  向日葵向太阳鞠躬\N{\fs14}Think of a sunflower. They bow to the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鞠得太低的向日葵...\N{\fs14}But if you see some that are too bowed down...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:19.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经枯死  你是侍者  不是下人\N{\fs14}it means they're dead! You're serving. You're not a servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.45,0:13:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,服务是高精艺术\N{\fs14}Serving is a supreme art.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.32,0:13:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝是第一位侍者\N{\fs14}God is the first servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝为人服务  但上帝不是下人\N{\fs14}God serves men, but he's not a servant to men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没有钮  -傻子  不应该有钮\N{\fs14}- There was no button here. - It doesn't go there, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:35.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把车开回家  还给爸爸  他还得用呢\N{\fs14}I have to take the car back to Pop. He's counting on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.17,0:13:38.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个月后再开回去吧\N{\fs14}You'll take it back in a month or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.39,0:13:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我很快就会开回去的  你知道怎么回事吗\N{\fs14}No, I've got to get it back soon. You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.35,0:13:43.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fs14}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:54.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-几点了  -你睡着了吗   \N{\fs14}- What? What time is it? - Were you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:55.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然睡着\N{\fs14}Of course I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:59.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能一边说一边睡\N{\fs14}You fell asleep while talking to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.95,0:14:01.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你怎么做到的  -叔本华\N{\fs14}- How did you do that? - Schopenhauer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:03.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叔本啥\N{\fs14}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叔本华  他说过  意志决定一切\N{\fs14}Schopenhauer says that with willpower, you can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想怎样  就能怎样\N{\fs14}"I am what I want to be."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:13.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想睡着  于是说...\N{\fs14}Right now I want to sleep, so I was saying to myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.51,0:14:15.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡着吧  睡着吧  于是我就睡着了\N{\fs14}"I'm sleeping, sleeping," and I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.14,0:14:18.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真神奇  也很简单\N{\fs14}Amazing. And it's simple too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.81,0:14:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也试试\N{\fs14}I want to try too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.56,0:14:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡着吧  睡着吧  睡着吧\N{\fs14}I'm sleeping, sleeping, sleeping...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:27.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要动手  现在不是玩杂耍\N{\fs14}Don't move your hands. You're not a juggler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是思想的功夫  要认真  慢慢来\N{\fs14}It's a matter of thought. It's serious, and it takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:32.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天再说吧\N{\fs14}We'll talk about it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神奇啊\N{\fs14}Amazing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.46,0:14:38.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒过来\N{\fs14}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:44.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒过来\N{\fs14}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又怎样  做什么\N{\fs14}What is it now? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:48.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-凑效了  -什么凑效了\N{\fs14}- It totally works! - What works?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叔本华  我刚刚说  醒过来\N{\fs14}Schopenhauer. You know what I just said? "Wake up."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就立即醒了过来  这理论太不可思议了\N{\fs14}Bam, you woke up. This theory is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.61,0:14:58.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好使吧  -你冲着我的耳朵喊\N{\fs14}- How does it work? - You were yelling in my ear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:14:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能不醒吗\N{\fs14}That's why I woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.36,0:15:04.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我该温柔点吗  -根本不该出声\N{\fs14}- So I should say it quieter. - Don't say it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.78,0:15:05.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好深奥啊\N{\fs14}It's deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.29,0:15:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要运用精神力量\N{\fs14}You have to think it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.05,0:15:17.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑什么  慢点\N{\fs14}Why are you running? Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.17,0:15:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  已经迟了\N{\fs14}Hurry up. It's late!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.80,0:15:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉  钥匙\N{\fs14}Mary, the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.26,0:15:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天早晨  她都把钥匙扔下来\N{\fs14}Every morning, she throws the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fs14}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.81,0:15:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女教师好标致啊\N{\fs14}There's that teacher. Boy, is she pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.65,0:15:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连做梦都梦见她\N{\fs14}I even dreamt about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.94,0:15:32.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  我给你介绍\N{\fs14}Come with me. I'll introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.15,0:15:35.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-靠  不要动  -怎么了\N{\fs14}- Holy smokes! Stay still! - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要动\N{\fs14}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车上的人  是那鸡蛋淋头的混蛋\N{\fs14}The one in the car. He's that jerk the eggs fell on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他见到我  会跟我拼命的\N{\fs14}He'll kill me if he sees me. Be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:46.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他在干什么  -在说话\N{\fs14}- What's he doing? - He's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-说啥呢  -我哪知道\N{\fs14}- What's he saying? - How do I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他在干什么  -道别\N{\fs14}- What's he doing? - He's saying goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的那部车和我的一模一样\N{\fs14}He's got a car just like mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:55.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来了\N{\fs14}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.89,0:15:58.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要动  他看到我我就死定了\N{\fs14}Don't move. He'll kill me if he sees me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:00.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要动  Ferruccio\N{\fs14}Stay still, Ferruccio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:06.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公主早\N{\fs14}Good morning, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.99,0:16:10.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是你  怎会这样巧\N{\fs14}It's you again. How do you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:14.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个从天而降的公主\N{\fs14}This is the princess who fell from the sky into my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是那个替你吸取毒液的人吗\N{\fs14}Is he the one who sucked the stinger out of your thigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:22.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  我们经常无意碰见\N{\fs14}Yes. We keep meeting like this. You just suddenly show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以约见\N{\fs14}We could make plans to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-今晚八点  -不  还是这样好\N{\fs14}- Tonight at 8:00? - No, it's nicer this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.89,0:16:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Dora  我们走  快迟到了\N{\fs14}Let's go, Dora. You'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.60,0:16:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望可以再次遇见你\N{\fs14}I hope we meet again suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.69,0:16:36.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见  公主\N{\fs14}Farewell, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:39.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到了吧  她多迷人\N{\fs14}Did you see her? She's pretty, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.03,0:16:41.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她喜欢我突然出现\N{\fs14}She likes it when I suddenly appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到啊\N{\fs14}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:55.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗\N{\fs14}"Obscurity."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.92,0:16:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个天才\N{\fs14}You're a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:16:59.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,越多越看不见\N{\fs14}"The bigger it is, the less you see it."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.09,0:17:01.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谜底是  黑暗\N{\fs14}Solution: obscurity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.05,0:17:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了不起\N{\fs14}Marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.43,0:17:05.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你自作的谜语  -不是\N{\fs14}- Did you make that riddle up? - No,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你五分钟就猜出来了  我却用了八天\N{\fs14}but you solved it in five minutes. It took me eight days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗\N{\fs14}Obscurity!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三文鱼  沙拉  和白酒一杯\N{\fs14}Salmon, salad and a glass of white wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.69,0:17:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再出个谜\N{\fs14}Listen to this one, Guido.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.36,0:17:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如轮到我出\N{\fs14}If I may, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:22.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候  听父亲说过\N{\fs14}My pop told me this when I was a wee boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白雪公主切饼招待七个小矮人\N{\fs14}"The dwarves and Snow White sit down for a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白雪公主切饼要切多\N{\fs14}How fast can you guess what she serves her guests next?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.30,0:17:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相当复杂\N{\fs14}It sounds refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:37.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就试一下\N{\fs14}I want to solve it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.10,0:17:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃完再猜吧  菜都凉了\N{\fs14}Eat first or it'll get cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.64,0:17:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我反正没胃口  时间太晚\N{\fs14}I don't want to. It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:43.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沙拉  三文鱼和白酒  都易消化\N{\fs14}Salad, salmon, white wine. It's light.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.15,0:17:45.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白雪公主...\N{\fs14}The dwarves...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:48.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和七个小矮人\N{\fs14}... and Snow White.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:55.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-厨房收了工  -是啊  怎么了\N{\fs14}- Is the kitchen closed? - Everybody's gone. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.49,0:17:58.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有位视学官从罗马来  想吃东西\N{\fs14}A gentleman from Rome is here from the ministry. He wants to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.00,0:17:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厨师收工了\N{\fs14}The kitchen is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:02.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他或者会给好多小费\N{\fs14}Oh, well, he would have given you a good tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.79,0:18:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厨师开工了\N{\fs14}The kitchen is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请进\N{\fs14}Come right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.94,0:18:17.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生  你什么都不吃吗\N{\fs14}Doctor, you're not eating anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.90,0:18:22.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白雪公主和七个小矮人…\N{\fs14}"The dwarves and Snow White..."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.61,0:18:28.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然厨房收工了  来点凉菜就行\N{\fs14}I know the kitchen is closed. Maybe a cold dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:30.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敝店菜色精美  请随便点\N{\fs14}It's all delicious. Take your pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要清淡一点的\N{\fs14}Something light.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有巨型牛排\N{\fs14}Well, we've got meat, a nice heavy steak...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.08,0:18:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有羊肉  腰子  酥炸肝\N{\fs14}lamb, kidneys, some greasy breaded liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还有鱼呢  -鱼\N{\fs14}- Otherwise, there's fish. - Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.34,0:18:43.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有...\N{\fs14}We have...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:44.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肥美鲮鱼\N{\fs14}a nice fatty turbot...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:47.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白兰地汁烩香肠酿鳝\N{\fs14}eel stuffed with fatty sausage and greased with Grand Marnier...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.73,0:18:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精瘦的三文鱼\N{\fs14}or some lean salmon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三文鱼  谢谢\N{\fs14}The salmon, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.65,0:18:54.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,配菜呢\N{\fs14}Side dish?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.07,0:18:56.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有配菜呢\N{\fs14}There's a side dish too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:19:00.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任您选择  我们有香炸鲜菇\N{\fs14}Of course. We have very, very fried mushrooms...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,牛油浓汁炆薯仔\N{\fs14}buttered potatoes in Nancy butter with a flaky sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要点清淡的沙拉  没有就什么都不要\N{\fs14}Is there a small, light salad? If not, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,清淡的沙拉  真可惜啊  香炸鲜菇…\N{\fs14}A light salad? What a pity. The very, very fried mushrooms...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:16.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滋味无穷  清淡沙拉…\N{\fs14}were out of this world. So, a light salad...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:19.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘦三文鱼  一杯白酒\N{\fs14}a lean salmon and a glass of white wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常好  请稍等\N{\fs14}Perfect. As soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.52,0:19:23.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会尽快的\N{\fs14}I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.75,0:19:43.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白雪公主多久才切完饼\N{\fs14}"How fast can you guess what she serves her guests next?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.25,0:19:44.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fs14}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:48.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-白雪公主和矮人  -晚安  医生\N{\fs14}- The dwarves and Snow White. - Good night, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:49.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安  天才\N{\fs14}Good night, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.30,0:19:55.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说什么了  白雪公主  喝茫了吧\N{\fs14}What did he say? The dwarves? What is he, drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.23,0:19:58.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个谜语  谜底是”七秒”\N{\fs14}It's a riddle. "Seven seconds."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.31,0:20:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答案是七秒  白雪公主和七个小矮人\N{\fs14}"Seven seconds" is the solution. "The dwarves and Snow White."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有七个小矮人吃饼\N{\fs14}If there are seven dwarves dining...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.07,0:20:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每人一份的话  总共就是”七秒”\N{\fs14}and she serves seconds, that means "seven seconds."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.07,0:20:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,second有”份”和”秒”两个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lessing医生太忠直老实了\N{\fs14}Doctor Lessing is a physician, a very serious person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:16.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他猜谜猜上瘾了  废寝忘食的\N{\fs14}But he's obsessed with riddles. He loses sleep over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.67,0:20:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问方济各学校...\N{\fs14}Excuse me. The "Francesco Petrarca" school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那间小学  我认识那里的一位老师\N{\fs14}The elementary school? A friend of mine teaches there. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:29.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离这里不远  怎么了\N{\fs14}It's not far from here. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  我可以睡多半个钟头\N{\fs14}Good. I can sleep an extra half hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明早非得去学校不可么\N{\fs14}Do you have to go to that school tomorrow morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,八点半必须到\N{\fs14}They're expecting me at 8:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.41,0:20:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位同学  请安静  我有话说\N{\fs14}Please, children, silence! A moment of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,视学官很快就要来了\N{\fs14}The inspector from Rome will be here shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.83,0:20:52.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家要给他个好印象\N{\fs14}I want to make a good impression on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.17,0:20:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说的话  大家都要用心听\N{\fs14}Listen very quietly and carefully to what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:21:00.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他将会报道美丽祖国的大事\N{\fs14}He'll tell us some very important things about our beautiful country.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:03.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,校长  视学官到了\N{\fs14}The inspector is here, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.81,0:21:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么快啊\N{\fs14}He's already here? He's early!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.77,0:21:08.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下  Roberto\N{\fs14}Sit down, Roberto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起立\N{\fs14}All rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.24,0:21:21.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好  公主\N{\fs14}Good morning, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.21,0:21:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好  视学官  我是这儿的校长\N{\fs14}Good morning, Mr. Inspector. I'm the principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:30.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这几位是敝校的教员\N{\fs14}These are some of our teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fs14}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.47,0:21:37.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么...\N{\fs14}Therefore...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.85,0:21:43.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在本区任教多少年了\N{\fs14}How many years have you taught in this school district?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:44.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,16年\N{\fs14}Sixteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.99,0:21:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教育部今年通过的教育方案...\N{\fs14}Are you up to date with the ongoing...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.99,0:21:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有好好领会\N{\fs14}school program approved by the ministry this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.33,0:21:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:59.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有阅读学童保健通告\N{\fs14}Did you read the bulletin regarding childhood hygiene?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然有\N{\fs14}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:05.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你星期天都干什么\N{\fs14}What are you doing on Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.18,0:22:08.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的星期天是指…\N{\fs14}No, I mean, Sunday is…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.85,0:22:11.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣母节  你都做什么\N{\fs14}St. Mary's Day. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去剧院\N{\fs14}I'm going to the theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.02,0:22:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-看什么  - Offenbach\N{\fs14}- To see what? - Offenbach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.32,0:22:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  正在上演Offenbach\N{\fs14}Right, they're playing Offenbach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.36,0:22:23.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  那么…\N{\fs14}Fine. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.95,0:22:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分感谢  再见  我是来...\N{\fs14}Thank you very much, and goodbye. I just came to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.83,0:22:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道\N{\fs14}We know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.67,0:22:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近  我们和罗马来的视学官...\N{\fs14}As you know, the inspector...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.88,0:22:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有意大利最权威的科学家\N{\fs14}came from Rome to talk to us about the race manifesto...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.09,0:22:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联合发表了一份种族宣\N{\fs14}signed by the most well versed Italian scientists.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.64,0:22:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们深感荣幸\N{\fs14}He will, and we're very honored,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:45.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,视学官会说明  我们的种族...\N{\fs14}demonstrate to us that our race
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.89,0:22:47.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是普天之下...\N{\fs14}is…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.85,0:22:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最优越的种族\N{\fs14}the best of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.61,0:22:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家坐\N{\fs14}Take your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.44,0:22:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,视学官  您请\N{\fs14}Go ahead, Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.99,0:22:59.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们的种族...  -是最优越的\N{\fs14}- Our race - Is superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.62,0:23:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是当然\N{\fs14}Naturally!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.20,0:23:04.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的种族是最优越的\N{\fs14}Our race is superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.16,0:23:07.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小朋友  我老远从罗马来...\N{\fs14}I've just come from Rome, right this minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.29,0:23:11.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是要教导你们  我们的种族\N{\fs14}to come and tell you in order that you'll know, children...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.01,0:23:13.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是最优越的种族\N{\fs14}that our race is a superior one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.05,0:23:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被...\N{\fs14}I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.47,0:23:18.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意大利的种族主义科学家...\N{\fs14}chosen, I was, by racist Italian scientists...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选中  来证明\N{\fs14}in order to demonstrate...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.27,0:23:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们种族的优越性\N{\fs14}how superior our race is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.07,0:23:29.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们  他们为什么偏偏选中我呢\N{\fs14}Why did they pick me, children?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.24,0:23:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问得多余\N{\fs14}Must I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:37.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比我更英俊的男子...\N{\fs14}Where can you find...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.37,0:23:40.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试问世间有没有\N{\fs14}someone more handsome than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然没有\N{\fs14}Justly so, there is silence. 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.88,0:23:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是纯正日耳曼人  最优越的种族\N{\fs14}I'm an original "superior race".
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.84,0:23:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许有人问...\N{\fs14}Let's start with something that one says:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.05,0:23:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么优越了\N{\fs14}"What's so big about that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.10,0:23:55.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耳朵  看看这耳朵多么完美\N{\fs14}The ear. Look at the perfection of this ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.73,0:23:57.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一弯耳轮...\N{\fs14}Left auricle...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.86,0:24:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,末端垂着耳珠  像个小铃铛\N{\fs14}with a pendant little bell at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.19,0:24:03.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精巧的软骨  活动自如\N{\fs14}Check it out. Movable cartilage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:05.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可伸可缩\N{\fs14}Bendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.66,0:24:08.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有这样的美耳  舍我其谁\N{\fs14}Find two ears more beautiful than these and I'll leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.49,0:24:12.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们找到另一对  我就卷铺盖走人\N{\fs14}But you have to show me them. They dream about these in France!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.54,0:24:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世间有不同种族  理所当然\N{\fs14}Races exist, children. You bet they do!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.84,0:24:18.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续  还有别的  我来示范\N{\fs14}But let's continue. I want to show you something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.97,0:24:20.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家留神\N{\fs14}Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.76,0:24:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他自称  视学官\N{\fs14}He said Inspector?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.14,0:24:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从罗马来\N{\fs14}From Rome?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.39,0:24:29.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肚脐\N{\fs14}The belly button!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.56,0:24:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧  脐带绑得多巧妙\N{\fs14}Take a look at this belly button! What a knot!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.69,0:24:37.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且解不开  用牙咬也咬不开\N{\fs14}But you can't untie it, not even with your teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:40.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,种族主义科学家想解  只是妄想\N{\fs14}Those racist scientists tried it. Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.32,0:24:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这意大利肚脐  属于我们的种族\N{\fs14}This is an Italian belly button. It's part of our race!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.83,0:24:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欣赏一下我的体形\N{\fs14}Check out this style!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.62,0:24:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这些肌肉\N{\fs14}Look at these muscles:
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.25,0:24:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单头肌  二头肌  三头肌\N{\fs14}ceps, biceps, triceps!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.55,0:24:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美仑美奂  见识见识这臀部\N{\fs14}Look at this beauty! Admire this hip!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.51,0:25:00.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,婀娜多姿\N{\fs14}Just look at the movement!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.06,0:25:02.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诸位\N{\fs14}Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.15,0:25:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要道别了\N{\fs14}I must say goodbye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.48,0:25:09.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不得不走  有约要赴\N{\fs14}I have to go. I have an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.61,0:25:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要告辞了  日耳他式的高贵离场\N{\fs14}I'll make my Aryan exit and bid you farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.74,0:25:15.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后会有期  大家保重肚脐\N{\fs14}Farewell! The belly button!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.45,0:25:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在威尼斯见  公主\N{\fs14}I'll see you in Venice, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.28,0:26:25.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只能用这对耳朵才听得到\N{\fs14}I can only hear out of this ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.14,0:26:45.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,望过来吧  公主\N{\fs14}Look at me, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.31,0:26:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,望过来  我在这里\N{\fs14}Go on, I'm down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.32,0:26:56.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,望过来吧  公主\N{\fs14}Look at me, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.13,0:27:12.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转过头来  公主\N{\fs14}Turn around, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.30,0:27:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转过来  转过来\N{\fs14}Turn around, around...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.69,0:27:55.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们想吃巧克力冰激凌  -那要快点吃\N{\fs14}- Can we get a chocolate ice cream? - Yes, but we'll have to be quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.15,0:27:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fs14}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.28,0:28:01.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,局长约了我们八点去吃饭\N{\fs14}We have to be at the prefect's at eight. We were invited to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.07,0:28:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-在哪  -局长官邸\N{\fs14}- Where? - At the prefect's.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.62,0:28:07.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下惨了  希望这不是真的\N{\fs14}Have pity on me, Lord. Let it not be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.83,0:28:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又要去应酬他\N{\fs14}Another dinner at the prefect's?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.83,0:28:11.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你母亲也去\N{\fs14}Your mother is coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.33,0:28:12.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惨\N{\fs14}Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.04,0:28:16.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起去吧  喝杯咖啡  坐一坐就走\N{\fs14}Let us just go to dinner. We'll stop by the prefect's for coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.05,0:28:19.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不去\N{\fs14}I'm not coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.30,0:28:21.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想去是吧  那我推掉他算了\N{\fs14}All right, I heard you! I'll tell him we're not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.85,0:28:23.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩个去别的地方吃吧\N{\fs14}It'll just be me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.81,0:28:28.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你好  Rodolfo  -你好  局长\N{\fs14}- Good evening, Rodolfo! - Good evening, Mr. Prefect.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.11,0:28:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得八点钟来我家\N{\fs14}I'll see you later at my house. I'll expect you at 8:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.19,0:28:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会准时到\N{\fs14}We'll be there at 8:00 sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.08,0:28:40.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在哪里  你看见了吗\N{\fs14}Where is she? Did you see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.54,0:28:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-必定在这里  -你来了\N{\fs14}- She has to be here. - You're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.13,0:28:47.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天准时  知道吗\N{\fs14}On time tomorrow, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.88,0:28:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有把那匹布搬下车\N{\fs14}Did you take that stuff out of the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.55,0:28:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是丝绸  小心  不要刮花\N{\fs14}It's silk. Don't ruin it. Be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.97,0:28:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这出戏真好看  -精彩\N{\fs14}- What an opera. - Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.94,0:29:01.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布帘是你的吗\N{\fs14}Is that one of your curtains?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.02,0:29:05.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  是我同事的\N{\fs14}No, it must be one of my colleague's.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.53,0:29:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他又怎么又偷我帽子\N{\fs14}He took my hat again!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.32,0:29:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们走  -你没看见外面下雨呢吗\N{\fs14}- Let's go. - Don't you see how it's raining?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.33,0:29:17.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你把车开过来  -就在附近\N{\fs14}- You go get the car. - It's right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  你在这里等\N{\fs14}All right, you wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.67,0:29:21.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会开过来  然后按喇叭\N{\fs14}I'll pull up right here and toot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.55,0:29:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙拿来\N{\fs14}Give me the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.13,0:29:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是门钥匙  是车钥匙\N{\fs14}Not the house key! The car key!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.72,0:29:31.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车钥匙  你有病啊\N{\fs14}The car key? Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.72,0:29:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个鸡蛋淋头的混蛋...\N{\fs14}Keep him busy, you know, the jerk the eggs fell on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.90,0:29:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去尽量拖住他  我们晚上见\N{\fs14}Keep him busy as long as you can. I'll see you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.40,0:29:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车上坐着…  慢点开\N{\fs14}Inside the car there's... Go slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.71,0:29:59.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你起码应该带把雨伞来\N{\fs14}The least you could have done is come get me with the umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.26,0:30:02.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一点风度都没有  看  给我弄得多狼狈\N{\fs14}You're just plain rude. Look what a mess I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.93,0:30:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要我应酬局长  好不自在\N{\fs14}Plus, dinner at the prefect's gets me so nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.52,0:30:10.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我感到不自在...\N{\fs14}I knew it. I've got the hiccups.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.61,0:30:13.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定打嗝\N{\fs14}I always get them when I'm made to do something I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.99,0:30:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我没有什么别的要求\N{\fs14}Don't you know that it takes so little to make me happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.87,0:30:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一两杯巧克力冰激凌  我就满足了\N{\fs14}A chocolate ice cream is enough! Even two!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.08,0:30:23.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家散散步  自自然然\N{\fs14}A nice walk together and then whatever happens happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.12,0:30:25.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你却...\N{\fs14}Instead you...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.67,0:30:29.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安  公主\N{\fs14}Good morning, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.09,0:30:34.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是你  你应该向我解释\N{\fs14}This is incredible. You owe me an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.39,0:30:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你才应该向我解释\N{\fs14}No, you're the one who owes me an explanation!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.72,0:30:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从天而降  落入我怀里\N{\fs14}I stop under a roof and you fall from the sky into my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.60,0:30:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从单车摔下  摔进你的怀里\N{\fs14}I fall off my bicycle and end up in your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.48,0:30:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去巡视学校  又碰到你\N{\fs14}I do an inspection at school, and there you are again!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.69,0:30:49.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我连做梦都梦见你\N{\fs14}You even turn up in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.95,0:30:54.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我清净清净行不行  你对我太痴缠\N{\fs14}Will you leave me alone? You've really got a crush on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.49,0:30:56.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也难怪  不过...\N{\fs14}I don't blame you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.46,0:31:00.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我投降  你赢了\N{\fs14}All right. At this point, I give in. You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.21,0:31:02.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到哪去  海  喜欢海吗\N{\fs14}Where shall we go, Princess? To the sea! Do you like the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.17,0:31:06.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,载我回剧院吧  有人等我呢\N{\fs14}Yes, but they're waiting for me at the theater. Take me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.63,0:31:09.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fs14}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.22,0:31:12.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公主  知道怎么开雨刷吗\N{\fs14}Princess, do you know how to turn on the windshield wipers?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.02,0:31:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刹车\N{\fs14}Step on the brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.02,0:31:18.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用怕  坐稳了\N{\fs14}Have no fear! Hang on to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.44,0:31:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,方向盘坏了\N{\fs14}It's broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.23,0:31:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候学的开车\N{\fs14}When did you learn to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.20,0:31:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-10分钟前  -没到10分钟吧\N{\fs14}- Ten minutes ago. - I thought it was less than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.28,0:31:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-车顶关不上  -车门打不开\N{\fs14}- The top doesn't close. - The door won't open.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.41,0:31:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们困住了\N{\fs14}Wait! We're stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.87,0:31:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定出得去  放心\N{\fs14}We'll get out of here. I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.33,0:31:36.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重要的是  你别淋湿了\N{\fs14}The important thing is that you don't get wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.09,0:31:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挡上点\N{\fs14}Cover yourself with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.38,0:31:41.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着  我们走\N{\fs14}Take it. We'll get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.22,0:31:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有我呢  放心\N{\fs14}I'll take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.39,0:31:48.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扶稳\N{\fs14}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.27,0:31:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧  公主\N{\fs14}Step right out, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.57,0:31:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧\N{\fs14}There! Step right out!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.61,0:32:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  有一潭水  别弄湿了你的脚\N{\fs14}There's a huge puddle! You'll get your feet wet! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.54,0:32:07.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行\N{\fs14}Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.34,0:32:16.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-走吧  -我们在哪\N{\fs14}- Go ahead, Princess. - Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.47,0:32:18.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在旧地重游\N{\fs14}We've already been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.72,0:32:20.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你我到过  几时\N{\fs14}Me and you? When?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.68,0:32:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你忘了?\N{\fs14}Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.64,0:32:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那晚下着雨\N{\fs14}The night it was raining...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.40,0:32:26.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用枕头给你遮雨\N{\fs14}and I made you an umbrella out of a pillow!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.90,0:32:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夜色迷人  我托着方向盘...\N{\fs14}It was a beautiful night. I put the steering wheel on my shoulder...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.86,0:32:34.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,翩翩起舞  舞至你面前\N{\fs14}did a little waltz, and when I stopped in front of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.03,0:32:35.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你赏我一吻\N{\fs14}you kissed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.97,0:32:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公主  后面风大  小心着凉\N{\fs14}Princess, your behind is blowing in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.35,0:32:56.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只听我喜欢的人的话\N{\fs14}It depends on the person. My pop was like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.35,0:33:00.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸生前  我肯听他话\N{\fs14}He had the ability to make me do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.44,0:33:02.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他了解我  懂得和我相处\N{\fs14}He understood me. He knew how to deal with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.86,0:33:05.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就像他膝头的小狗狗\N{\fs14}I was like putty in his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.24,0:33:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从不拒绝\N{\fs14}I always, always, always said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.53,0:33:11.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说  你这个百宝箱...\N{\fs14}So, all these treasures you're hiding,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.12,0:33:16.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一但打开  你就千依百顺\N{\fs14}there is a way to open this treasure chest
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.00,0:33:18.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从不拒绝\N{\fs14}and always get you to say yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.21,0:33:21.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找到适合的钥匙就行\N{\fs14}All you need is the right key.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.26,0:33:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样找到\N{\fs14}And where exactly is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.68,0:33:24.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天晓得\N{\fs14}Heaven knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.85,0:33:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云散了\N{\fs14}It's clearing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.60,0:33:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说…\N{\fs14}So, you were saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.56,0:33:32.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那把钥匙必定从天而降\N{\fs14}the key that always makes you say yes has to come from heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.77,0:33:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.36,0:33:35.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要试试\N{\fs14}I'll give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.15,0:33:40.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定圣母玛莉会赏给我\N{\fs14}lf the Virgin Mary tosses it down to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.26,0:33:39.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定呢\N{\fs14}You never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.16,0:33:43.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Mary  钥匙\N{\fs14}Mary, the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.54,0:33:47.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这把吗\N{\fs14}Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.46,0:33:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真要回家  不吃巧克力冰激凌吗\N{\fs14}Do you really have to go home? What about the chocolate ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.05,0:33:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-现在去吃吧  -现在不行\N{\fs14}- Let's get it right now. - No, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.88,0:33:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那要什么时候  -不知道\N{\fs14}- Then when? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.55,0:34:00.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是天晓得\N{\fs14}Are we going to let heaven decide that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.22,0:34:04.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再为小事麻烦Mary了\N{\fs14}No, leave Mary alone. Don't bother her over an ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.19,0:34:08.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候吃冰激凌  不是小事  是大事\N{\fs14}No, it's way too important. We can't decide when to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.62,0:34:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要问她\N{\fs14}I have to ask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.17,0:34:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Mary  派人来通知\N{\fs14}Mary, send someone to find out...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.55,0:34:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候能吃上冰激凌\N{\fs14}how long before we can have the ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.66,0:34:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七秒钟\N{\fs14}Seven seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.54,0:34:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这是我的家  -我经过了千百次\N{\fs14}- This is my house. – I've gone by here a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.17,0:34:30.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次都自忖  谁现在住在这儿\N{\fs14}I've always asked myself: Who lives there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.26,0:34:32.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想在对街开间店铺\N{\fs14}I wanted to open my store right out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.55,0:34:35.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-书店  -对  可以天天见到你\N{\fs14}- The bookshop? - Yes. I'll see you every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.56,0:34:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fs14}Goodbye then.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.18,0:34:40.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我很好  我现在只想洗个澡\N{\fs14}You've been so nice to me. All I want now is a hot bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.19,0:34:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有句话想说\N{\fs14}I forgot to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.03,0:34:45.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fs14}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.61,0:34:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想像不到  我多渴望和你做爱\N{\fs14}You can't imagine how much I feel like making love to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.78,0:34:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我绝不会告诉任何人  尤其是你\N{\fs14}But I'll never tell anyone, especially not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.04,0:34:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非严刑逼供  否则我绝对不说\N{\fs14}They'd have to torture me to make me say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.12,0:34:57.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么\N{\fs14}Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.50,0:34:59.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说我想和你做爱\N{\fs14}That I want to make love to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.50,0:35:01.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不仅做一次  是做完又做\N{\fs14}Not just once. Over and over again!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.30,0:35:03.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非我神经错乱\N{\fs14}But I'll never tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.01,0:35:07.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则不会透露  我渴望和你做爱\N{\fs14}I'd have to be crazy to tell you I'd even make love to you now...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.39,0:35:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就想做  做足一生一世\N{\fs14}right here, for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.94,0:35:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又快下雨了  你还是快走吧\N{\fs14}You'd better run or you'll get wet. It's going to rain again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.69,0:35:16.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公主\N{\fs14}Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.23,0:35:18.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你湿透了\N{\fs14}You're all wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.65,0:35:20.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西装湿了就湿了吧\N{\fs14}My suit is no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.45,0:35:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帽子湿了才不舒服\N{\fs14}It's that hat that bothers me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.62,0:35:26.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要顶干帽子  哪里有呢\N{\fs14}I need a dry hat, but where can I find one?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.04,0:35:30.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才用的方法  我有样学样\N{\fs14}How did it go? Right, it's easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.96,0:35:35.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Mary  派人送顶干帽子给他\N{\fs14}Mary, send someone to give my friend a dry hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.22,0:35:45.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安  公主  再见了\N{\fs14}Good night, Princess. Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.63,0:36:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问洗手间在哪里\N{\fs14}Excuse me, where's the restroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.42,0:36:08.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直走  左手边\N{\fs14}Straight ahead to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.68,0:36:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再不起床...\N{\fs14}If you don't get up immediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.60,0:36:23.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在你亡父灵前发誓  再不理你\N{\fs14}I swear on your father's deathbed I'll never speak to you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.69,0:36:25.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也不搭理你\N{\fs14}For the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.44,0:36:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我数三声\N{\fs14}I'm going to count to three now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.40,0:36:31.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再不起床  我就把你拽起来\N{\fs14}lf you don't get up, I'll force you to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.31,0:36:32.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一\N{\fs14}One...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.77,0:36:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二\N{\fs14}two...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.82,0:36:38.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三\N{\fs14}and three.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.92,0:36:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好孩子\N{\fs14}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.55,0:36:49.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道谁快要结婚了吗\N{\fs14}Do you know who's getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.68,0:36:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸡蛋淋头的混蛋\N{\fs14}Didn't I tell you? That jerk the eggs fell on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.15,0:36:58.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-娶谁  -不知道\N{\fs14}- Who's he marrying? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.73,0:37:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新娘还未出现\N{\fs14}But she hasn't even shown up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.90,0:37:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人人都在等着\N{\fs14}Everybody's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.74,0:37:04.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找你找得好辛苦\N{\fs14}I've looked everywhere for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.37,0:37:06.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你叔叔  -我叔叔\N{\fs14}- Your uncle. - My uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.16,0:37:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他出事了  跟我来\N{\fs14}Something's happened. Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.20,0:37:10.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到外面  马\N{\fs14}Outside! The horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.88,0:37:15.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fs14}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.38,0:37:17.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的马\N{\fs14}Is that your horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.42,0:37:21.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真见鬼  上面涂着什么\N{\fs14}What a sight! What did they write on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.05,0:37:23.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心  犹太马\N{\fs14}"Achtung, Jewish horse."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.72,0:37:28.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是那班野蛮人做的好事\N{\fs14}The usual barbarians, vandals. It's sad. What nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.77,0:37:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犹太马\N{\fs14}"Jewish horse"!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.19,0:37:34.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要生气  他们只是…\N{\fs14}Don't get upset. They just did it to...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.57,0:37:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是孤立的事件\N{\fs14}They didn't do it to... They did it "to."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.03,0:37:41.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要习惯一下\N{\fs14}You'll have to get used to it, Guido.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.49,0:37:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也会找你麻烦\N{\fs14}They'll start with you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.12,0:37:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找我麻烦  怎样找\N{\fs14}With me? What could possibly happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.54,0:37:49.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顶多把我剥光  给我染黄  涂上...\N{\fs14}The worst they can do is undress me, paint me yellow and write...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.50,0:37:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心  犹太侍应\N{\fs14}"Achtung, Jewish waiter."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.34,0:37:54.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不说不知  原来这匹马是犹太马\N{\fs14}I didn't even know this horse was Jewish.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.14,0:37:57.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  明早我会把马洗干净\N{\fs14}Let's go. I'll clean him up in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.93,0:37:59.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,牵它回马厩\N{\fs14}Take him back to the stall.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.91,0:38:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  你前面\N{\fs14}Look, there, in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.76,0:38:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  我想给她一个惊喜\N{\fs14}Wait. I'll surprise her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.06,0:38:40.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  我介绍Fido Giovanardi给你认识\N{\fs14}Come with me. I'd like to introduce you to Fido Giovanardi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.29,0:38:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lessing医生  到哪里去\N{\fs14}Doctor Lessing! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.83,0:38:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我接到急电  要立即回柏林\N{\fs14}Urgent telegram. I must go to Berlin immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.72,0:39:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么拿着盘花  -为你践行\N{\fs14}- What are these flowers? - They're for your departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.89,0:39:07.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要一枝\N{\fs14}I'll take just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.77,0:39:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会跟我妻子说  Guido送的花\N{\fs14}I'll take it to my wife: Guido's flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.02,0:39:14.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你交友  是人生一快\N{\fs14}I truly enjoyed myself with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.53,0:39:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是一位...\N{\fs14}You're the most ingenious...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.53,0:39:18.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有才智的侍者\N{\fs14}waiter I've ever come across.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.32,0:39:22.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里  你是一位很有修养的顾客\N{\fs14}Thank you. You're the customer with the most culture I've ever served.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.08,0:39:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里\N{\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.66,0:39:26.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见  Lessing医生\N{\fs14}Goodbye, Doctor Lessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.62,0:39:28.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜这个谜\N{\fs14}By the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.34,0:39:32.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一提起我...\N{\fs14}"lf you say my name...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.09,0:39:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就消失  我是谁?\N{\fs14}I'm not there anymore. Who am I?"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.64,0:39:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一提起我  我就消失\N{\fs14}If you say my name, I'm not there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.56,0:39:46.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  他说什么\N{\fs14}What is it? What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.90,0:39:50.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谜底  沉默\N{\fs14}"Silence!"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.61,0:39:55.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妙  一说那字  字就消失  沉默\N{\fs14}Beautiful. If you say the word, it's not there anymore. Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.33,0:40:00.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的不是大都会  是乡下\N{\fs14}I'm not talking about Berlin, in the outskirts. Imagine that!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.58,0:40:05.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三年级学生  听好了\N{\fs14}Third grade. Listen to this problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.71,0:40:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得这题是因为它难住过我\N{\fs14}I remember it because it shocked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.05,0:40:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国家每养一疯子  每日花4马克\N{\fs14}A lunatic costs the state four marks a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.05,0:40:14.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每养一瘸子  4.5马克\N{\fs14}A cripple, four and a half marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.93,0:40:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,癫痫患者  3.5马克\N{\fs14}An epileptic, three marks and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.85,0:40:20.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些废人人数达30万\N{\fs14}Considering that the average is four marks a day...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.90,0:40:23.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,设  国家平均每人每日花4马克\N{\fs14}and there are 300,000 patients, how much would the state save...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.24,0:40:27.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将他们全部除掉  可节省多少\N{\fs14}if these individuals were eliminated?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.66,0:40:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真离谱\N{\fs14}I can't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.20,0:40:32.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也觉得离谱\N{\fs14}That was my exact reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.41,0:40:34.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七岁小孩\N{\fs14}I can't believe a seven-year-old child...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.46,0:40:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么算得出来\N{\fs14}has to solve this kind of equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.09,0:40:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想计算出来  要略懂比例...\N{\fs14}It's a difficult calculation. Proportions, percentages.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.47,0:40:44.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,略懂百分率  还要略懂代数\N{\fs14}They need at least some algebra to do those equations.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.39,0:40:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是中学的数学啊\N{\fs14}That's high school material for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.51,0:40:50.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用乘法就行  有30万个废人吗\N{\fs14}No, all it takes is multiplication. You said there are 300,000 cripples?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.65,0:40:52.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,30万乘以4\N{\fs14}300,000 times four.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.11,0:40:56.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部除掉  每日节省一百二十万马克\N{\fs14}If we killed them all, we'd save 1,200,000 marks a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.73,0:40:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很容易嘛\N{\fs14}It's easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.40,0:40:59.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得对\N{\fs14}Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.70,0:41:04.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你是成年人  他们是七岁小孩\N{\fs14}But you're an adult. They make seven-year-old children do this in Germany!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.45,0:41:06.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德国人的确是另一个种族\N{\fs14}It's truly another race.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.54,0:41:11.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安  公主\N{\fs14}"Good morning, Princess."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.25,0:41:16.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你说什么  -蛋糕上的字\N{\fs14}- What did you say? - It's here, on the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.32,0:41:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要呆若木鸡\N{\fs14}Why are you just standing there? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.49,0:41:40.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去跳舞吧\N{\fs14}Let's dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.75,0:42:18.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我简单说几句\N{\fs14}Just a few words. You already know it all by now...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.04,0:42:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们已经非常了解\N{\fs14}and you've known for several years.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.42,0:42:23.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和Dora生在同一条街\N{\fs14}Dora and l were born on the same street.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.68,0:42:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上同一间学校  交同一群朋友\N{\fs14}We went to school together, we had the same friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.27,0:42:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今生  我非Dora不娶\N{\fs14}Dora is the woman of my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.14,0:42:34.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Dora也非我不嫁  所以\N{\fs14}and I'm the man in her life, therefore...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.52,0:42:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们决定今年结婚\N{\fs14}we've decided to get married within the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.53,0:42:41.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭请各位亲友  四月九日...\N{\fs14}You're all officially invited on April the 9th...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.49,0:42:43.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到巴西里加圣玛莉感恩教堂观礼\N{\fs14}to the Basilica of Santa Maria del Pellegrino.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.91,0:42:47.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后来这里  一起通宵庆祝\N{\fs14}And then we'll celebrate till dawn all together, right here...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.87,0:42:50.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像现在一样  喜气洋洋\N{\fs14}just as happy as we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.51,0:43:00.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲亲未来新娘\N{\fs14}Kiss her! Kiss her!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.56,0:43:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有什么不对劲 -没有\N{\fs14}- What's wrong with you? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.06,0:43:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你没事吧  -没事\N{\fs14}- Are you all right? - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.77,0:43:12.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁把椅子放这里的\N{\fs14}Who put this armchair here?

Dialogue: 0,0:43:14,11,0:43:15,36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fs14}Are you all right?

Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.07,0:43:16.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没事  -我很遗憾\N{\fs14}- I'm fine. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.24,0:43:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没受伤  -我是指...\N{\fs14}- I didn't get hurt. - No, l was talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.33,0:43:21.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-玩得开心吗  -不错\N{\fs14}- Are you enjoying yourself? - It's going fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.87,0:43:23.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到你那桌去\N{\fs14}Go back to your table.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.96,0:43:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  我会清理的\N{\fs14}Go on. I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.18,0:43:36.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你没事吧  -我很好\N{\fs14}- Are you all right? - Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.81,0:43:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人人都问我有没有事  为什么\N{\fs14}Why are you all asking me that? Is there something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.44,0:43:43.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fs14}No, nothing is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.12,0:43:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…\N{\fs14}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.48,0:43:48.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到厨房去\N{\fs14}Go to the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.28,0:43:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到厨房去\N{\fs14}The kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.79,0:43:57.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚所有的东西都搬走了\N{\fs14}They moved everything around tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.92,0:43:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厨房也搬了  看\N{\fs14}Look where they put the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.39,0:44:12.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜谁来了\N{\fs14}Peekaboo! Guess who?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.64,0:44:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我呀  怎么没反应\N{\fs14}It's me! What, have you gone soft?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.56,0:44:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐\N{\fs14}Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.32,0:44:20.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于有幸见面  Dora\N{\fs14}We finally meet, Dora.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.94,0:44:24.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会介绍  你没胆介绍吧\N{\fs14}He never introduced us. You were scared to, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.12,0:44:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后你不用跟我们上妓院了\N{\fs14}Now you don't need to come with us to the brothel anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.33,0:44:32.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰打扰  恭喜恭喜\N{\fs14}I apologize if I've disrupted you. Happiness and best wishes to all.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.67,0:44:34.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这老滑头\N{\fs14}You sly old dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.46,0:44:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多么风趣的人\N{\fs14}What a jolly fellow!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.43,0:44:44.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我会清理的\N{\fs14}Everything is just fine. I'll pick it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.64,0:44:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fs14}I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.12,0:44:59.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公主\N{\fs14}Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.24,0:45:01.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也在这里\N{\fs14}You're here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.64,0:45:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我走\N{\fs14}Take me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.87,0:45:35.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位嘉宾\N{\fs14}And now, ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.24,0:45:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本酒店酬谢惠顾  谨致送贺礼\N{\fs14}a magnificent surprise offered by the Grand Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.46,0:45:41.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊塞俄比亚式蛋糕\N{\fs14}The Ethiopian cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.82,0:46:38.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  请奏乐\N{\fs14}Thank you! Music, maestro!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.58,0:46:44.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-恭喜恭喜  -谢谢\N{\fs14}- Congratulations. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.25,0:46:45.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.54,0:46:48.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请上马  公主\N{\fs14}Right this way, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.38,0:46:51.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你似乎是...\N{\fs14}But you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.71,0:46:54.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  公主\N{\fs14}Quickly, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.83,0:47:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他似乎是...\N{\fs14}But he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.50,0:47:23.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是那个鸡蛋流氓\N{\fs14}He's that jerk with the eggs!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.80,0:48:00.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ferruccio\N{\fs14}Ferruccio!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.59,0:48:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门钥匙在他那儿  真倒霉\N{\fs14}He's got the keys to the house, darn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.77,0:48:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁线  有铁线我就打得开\N{\fs14}Some wire. I can open it if I find some wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.23,0:48:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是铁线能手  家传绝技\N{\fs14}I'm a whiz with wire. My pop taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.90,0:48:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小时候  我用铁线做玩具\N{\fs14}l used to make toys out of wire when l was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.33,0:48:29.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开了\N{\fs14}l opened it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.95,0:48:58.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Joshua\N{\fs14}Joshua!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.04,0:49:03.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走  妈妈等着呢\N{\fs14}Let's go. You're going to make Mommy late.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.09,0:49:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的坦克丢了\N{\fs14}I lost my tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.80,0:49:12.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心  我们会找到的\N{\fs14}Don't worry. We'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.43,0:49:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放哪儿了\N{\fs14}Where did you leave the tank?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.60,0:49:17.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-楼梯上  -我去拿\N{\fs14}- It's on the stairs. - I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.06,0:49:20.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓稳  我去拿\N{\fs14}Hold the bicycle. I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.82,0:49:24.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦克\N{\fs14}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.15,0:49:27.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起程\N{\fs14}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.57,0:49:31.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-爸爸  加油  -慢点\N{\fs14}- Go, Pop! - Go slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.08,0:49:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你上课要迟到了\N{\fs14}You're late for school! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.50,0:49:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有匹马  两匹\N{\fs14}There's a horse! Two horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.46,0:49:42.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要按铃  吵死我了\N{\fs14}Stop ringing that bell! It's driving me mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.46,0:49:46.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不是我  是Joshua  -不是我  是爸爸\N{\fs14}- It's not me. It's Joshua. - It's not me. It's Pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.34,0:49:47.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我下车\N{\fs14}Stop it! Let me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.11,0:49:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了\N{\fs14}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.94,0:50:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚见\N{\fs14}See you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.37,0:50:06.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸  踩快点\N{\fs14}Go fast, Pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.03,0:50:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以买个饼给妈妈吗\N{\fs14}Can we buy this for Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.57,0:50:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-多少钱  -15里拉\N{\fs14}- How much does it cost? - Fifteen lire.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.95,0:50:26.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是个假饼  就像你的坦克\N{\fs14}It's a fake. It's probably a fake cake, like your tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.62,0:50:27.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧\N{\fs14}Let's go, Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.41,0:50:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犹太人与狗...\N{\fs14}"No Jews or dogs...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.63,0:50:33.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准入内\N{\fs14}allowed."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.38,0:50:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么犹太人与狗不准入内\N{\fs14}Why aren't Jews or dogs allowed to go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.22,0:50:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不欢迎犹太人和狗\N{\fs14}They just don't want Jews or dogs to go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.93,0:50:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各有各喜恶\N{\fs14}Everybody does what they want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.81,0:50:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里有间五金店铺\N{\fs14}There's a hardware store there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.73,0:50:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不欢迎西班牙人和马进去\N{\fs14}They don't let Spanish people or horses into his store.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.65,0:50:52.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再前点  有间药房\N{\fs14}Further ahead, there's a drugstore.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.03,0:50:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个中国人想拖着袋鼠进去\N{\fs14}I was with a Chinese friend of mine yesterday who had a kangaroo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.66,0:50:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  我们能进去吗  华人与袋鼠  不准入内\N{\fs14}I said, "May we?" "No, we don't want any Chinese or kangaroos here."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.91,0:51:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,店主不欢迎  有什么办法\N{\fs14}They don't like them. What can l tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.29,0:51:03.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的书店谁都欢迎\N{\fs14}We let everybody into our bookshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.83,0:51:06.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  从现在起  我们也要竖个牌\N{\fs14}No. From now on, we'll write it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.29,0:51:08.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你不喜欢什么  -蜘蛛  你呢\N{\fs14}- Is there anybody you don't like? - Spiders. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.34,0:51:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢西哥特人  明天竖个牌\N{\fs14}I don't like Visigoths. Starting tomorrow we'll write...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.09,0:51:13.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛与西哥特人  不准入内\N{\fs14}"No spiders and Visigoths allowed."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.84,0:51:17.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最讨厌就是西哥特人\N{\fs14}I'm sick and tired of these Visigoths.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.40,0:51:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安\N{\fs14}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.49,0:51:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部半价\N{\fs14}Everything's half price.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.45,0:51:30.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Guido Orefice\N{\fs14}- Guido Orefice?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.24,0:51:32.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是我\N{\fs14}That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.99,0:51:34.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请到市政局去\N{\fs14}You have to come to the prefect's.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.00,0:51:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又要去\N{\fs14}Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.75,0:51:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他去过  -走吧\N{\fs14}- He already went. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.58,0:51:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fs14}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.46,0:51:44.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那人跟你一起  -是  走吧\N{\fs14}- Is that man with you? - Yes. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.63,0:51:46.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行\N{\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.01,0:51:48.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也去\N{\fs14}I'm coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.76,0:51:51.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要去  我不会去太久  对吗?\N{\fs14}No. You stay here. It won't take long, will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.22,0:51:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快回来\N{\fs14}Not long at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.77,0:51:56.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Joshua 好好招呼客人\N{\fs14}Joshua, make sure you treat the customers good!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.23,0:51:58.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很快回来\N{\fs14}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.64,0:53:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要这本书\N{\fs14}I'll take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.40,0:53:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,5里拉\N{\fs14}It costs five lire.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.11,0:53:08.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面写着10里拉\N{\fs14}No, it says ten lire.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.03,0:53:10.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部半价\N{\fs14}Everything's half price.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.58,0:53:16.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给你妈妈  告诉她...\N{\fs14}Give this to your mom and tell her…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.00,0:53:18.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是外婆的\N{\fs14}it's from Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.50,0:53:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从未见过外婆\N{\fs14}I've never seen my grandma before.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.09,0:53:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想见吗\N{\fs14}Would you like to meet her?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.63,0:53:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想\N{\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.88,0:53:27.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明天就见得到\N{\fs14}You'll meet her tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.09,0:53:29.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-明天  -嗯\N{\fs14}- Tomorrow? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.51,0:53:32.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为明天是你生日\N{\fs14}Because tomorrow is your birthday...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.39,0:53:35.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你外婆会带份大礼来\N{\fs14}and your grandma will come and bring you a nice present.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.31,0:53:37.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的坦克\N{\fs14}A new tank?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.60,0:53:39.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  令你惊喜的礼物\N{\fs14}No, a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.90,0:53:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这封信交给你妈妈\N{\fs14}Give the letter to your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.61,0:53:44.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜  Joshua\N{\fs14}Bye, Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.07,0:53:47.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外婆  你零钱落了\N{\fs14}You forgot your change, Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.83,0:53:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.96,0:53:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你什么时候回来  -一个钟头左右\N{\fs14}- When are you coming? - In an hour or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.46,0:54:01.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去找叔叔  或者他那里有剩饭\N{\fs14}I'm going to stop by my uncle's to see if he'll bring some leftovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.26,0:54:04.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-外婆怎么说  -她明天来\N{\fs14}- Then what did Grandma say? - She's coming tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.89,0:54:08.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早就该来\N{\fs14}It's about time!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.44,0:54:10.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犹太店铺\N{\fs14}JEWISH STORE
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.29,0:54:14.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-该你洗澡了  -我不想洗\N{\fs14}- It's time for your bath now. - I don't want to take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.48,0:54:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-去洗澡  -我星期五洗过\N{\fs14}- Go take a bath. - I took one on Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.24,0:54:18.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说得对\N{\fs14}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.32,0:54:20.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去换衬衫\N{\fs14}You change your shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.95,0:54:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我星期四换过  -别忘记把花摘掉\N{\fs14}- I changed it on Thursday! - Don't forget the flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.04,0:54:25.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在外面  我已经摘了\N{\fs14}They're outside. I already picked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.16,0:54:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我也去  爸爸  -你要洗澡  小顽固\N{\fs14}- I'll come with you, Pop! - You have to take a bath, stubborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.34,0:54:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不洗\N{\fs14}I don't want to take one!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.26,0:54:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  我要去接外婆\N{\fs14}Hurry up. I have to go pick Grandma up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.89,0:54:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-想把鲜花放在哪   -放下  我等会插\N{\fs14}- Where do you want the flowers? - Set them down. I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.78,0:54:57.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我星期五洗过\N{\fs14}l took one on Friday!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.50,0:55:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Joshua呢\N{\fs14}Do you know where Joshua is?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.59,0:55:07.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定在房里\N{\fs14}He must be in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.67,0:55:09.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收拾一下好吗\N{\fs14}Will you put those things in order?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.55,0:55:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花很漂亮  拿来给我看看好吗\N{\fs14}Why don't you show me the flowers? They look so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.05,0:55:14.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是很漂亮  你要看吗  我给他们拿过来\N{\fs14}They are. I'll bring them right over. You want to see the flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.85,0:55:18.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就拿过来\N{\fs14}I'll make them come right over.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.94,0:55:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  花朵\N{\fs14}Come, flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.77,0:55:22.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  小柜\N{\fs14}Come, nightstand!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.19,0:55:23.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Schopenhauer  意志力  小柜来\N{\fs14}Schopenhauer, willpower, I want the nightstand to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.40,0:55:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小柜来\N{\fs14}Nightstand, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.62,0:55:29.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小柜停\N{\fs14}Stop, nightstand!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.16,0:55:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小柜不洗澡  好脏\N{\fs14}The nightstand seems very dirty to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.91,0:55:36.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安  公主\N{\fs14}Good morning, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.13,0:55:43.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经识字了吗\N{\fs14}He can already read and write?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.30,0:55:46.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-识了一年了  -你教得真好\N{\fs14}- For over a year now. - You did a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.30,0:55:47.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到了\N{\fs14}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.27,0:55:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我扶你下车\N{\fs14}I'll help you get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.23,0:55:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己可以\N{\fs14}No, l can do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.50,0:56:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Dora  什么事\N{\fs14}Dora, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.11,0:56:33.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到了没有\N{\fs14}Are we there?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.45,0:56:35.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  到了十字路口\N{\fs14}No, it's a crossing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.32,0:56:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们究竟要到哪去\N{\fs14}Will you tell me where we're going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.45,0:56:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到哪去  什么意思\N{\fs14}What do you mean, where?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.79,0:56:44.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都问过好多次了  我们要去...\N{\fs14}You asked me a thousand times. We're going...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.88,0:56:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个地方  那地方叫什么来着\N{\fs14}to the place... What's it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.01,0:56:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要到...\N{\fs14}We're going...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.30,0:56:50.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要到哪里去\N{\fs14}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.59,0:56:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天是什么日子  你的生日啊\N{\fs14}What day is it today? Today is your birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.10,0:56:58.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直说  你想旅行\N{\fs14}You've always said you wanted to go on a trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.56,0:57:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了这趟旅行  我筹备了好几个月\N{\fs14}It took me months to plan this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.94,0:57:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我们到哪里去吗\N{\fs14}You know where we're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.74,0:57:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我答应了妈妈  不能说\N{\fs14}I can't tell you. I promised Mom I wouldn't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.99,0:57:09.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说出来  她会生气的\N{\fs14}You know how she is. She'll get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.91,0:57:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之保证你会满意\N{\fs14}It makes me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.95,0:57:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候  爸爸也计划了一次旅行\N{\fs14}My pop planned something like this for me when l was little too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.08,0:57:18.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的好…  好好玩\N{\fs14}It was so... Boy, it was funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.13,0:57:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先不告诉你\N{\fs14}I'm not going to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.72,0:57:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你自己看看\N{\fs14}I want you to see for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.06,0:57:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你来个惊喜\N{\fs14}It's a surprise. You know, it's really...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.14,0:57:34.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保证你满意\N{\fs14}It really makes me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.27,0:57:36.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我累了\N{\fs14}I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.23,0:57:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡觉吧\N{\fs14}Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.45,0:57:48.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们带我们到哪处去\N{\fs14}Where are we going? Where are they taking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.94,0:58:12.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在几点了  我们准时出发\N{\fs14}What time is it? We're leaving right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.11,0:58:14.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多么有效率啊\N{\fs14}What organization!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.86,0:58:17.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你没坐过火车  -没有  很棒吗\N{\fs14}- You've never taken a train, huh? - No. Is it nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.62,0:58:18.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很棒\N{\fs14}It's really nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.12,0:58:21.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面全部是木造的  人人都站着\N{\fs14}It's all wooden inside. Everybody stands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.24,0:58:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有座位\N{\fs14}There's not one seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.58,0:58:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-一个座位都没有吗  -火车怎会有座位\N{\fs14}- There aren't any seats? - What? Seats on a train?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.96,0:58:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真土  没坐过火车吧\N{\fs14}It's obvious you've never been on one!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.25,0:58:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人人都要站着  挤得很近\N{\fs14}No, everybody stands real close together.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.97,0:58:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到这条长龙了吗  我刚刚抢到了票\N{\fs14}Do you see this line? I got the last tickets just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.18,0:58:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Eliseo叔叔  快点  否则赶不上了\N{\fs14}Hurry up, Uncle Eliseo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.93,0:58:40.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想听到他们说  太晚了  回家吧\N{\fs14}I don't want them to say, "Too late. It's full. Go back home."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.27,0:58:43.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们定了位  借下光\N{\fs14}Wait up. We've got a reservation! Leave some room for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.52,0:58:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  人龙多长\N{\fs14}Look at this line!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.15,0:58:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了  我们定了位\N{\fs14}Here we are! We made a reservation!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.58,0:58:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fs14}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.50,0:58:59.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要帮助吗\N{\fs14}May l help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.88,0:59:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必定有误会\N{\fs14}There's been a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.80,0:59:05.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么误会\N{\fs14}What mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.09,0:59:08.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我丈夫和儿子在那车上\N{\fs14}My husband and son are on that train.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.93,0:59:11.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你丈夫叫什么\N{\fs14}What's your husband's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.27,0:59:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Guido Orefice\N{\fs14}Guido Orefice.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.19,0:59:22.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Orefice的儿子\N{\fs14}Joshua Orefice...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.11,0:59:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Orefice的叔叔\N{\fs14}and Eliseo Orefice
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.28,0:59:25.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都在那节车上\N{\fs14}are on that train too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.41,0:59:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有误会\N{\fs14}There's no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.95,0:59:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要上那节车\N{\fs14}I want to get on that train too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.96,0:59:35.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了\N{\fs14}We're all ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.13,0:59:37.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起程吧\N{\fs14}Send them off then.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.92,0:59:39.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起程\N{\fs14}Go, leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.80,0:59:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去吧  太太\N{\fs14}Go back home, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.02,0:59:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想上车\N{\fs14}I want to get on that train.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.53,0:59:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我上车\N{\fs14}Let me get on that train!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.07,1:00:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈来了\N{\fs14}Mom's here!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.28,1:00:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们停下火车  让妈妈上来\N{\fs14}They stopped the train to let Mom get on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.94,1:02:41.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Eliseo叔叔\N{\fs14}Uncle Eliseo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.16,1:03:24.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看清楚没有  好玩吗  累吗\N{\fs14}Are you happy? Did you see this place? Are you tired?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.33,1:03:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不喜欢火车  -我也不喜欢\N{\fs14}- I didn't like the train. – Me, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.96,1:03:30.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会坐巴士回家\N{\fs14}We'll take the bus back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.83,1:03:34.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要坐巴士走  有座位的巴士\N{\fs14}We're taking the bus back! The one with the seats in it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.46,1:03:36.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我对他们说了  -说得好\N{\fs14}- I told them. - It's better.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.47,1:03:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吗  井井有条\N{\fs14}You see? It's all organized!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.47,1:03:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到人龙了吗  大家得排队进去\N{\fs14}Did you see that line? People are lined up to get inside!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.35,1:03:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人人都想进去\N{\fs14}Everybody wants to get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.02,1:03:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在玩什么游戏\N{\fs14}What game is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.61,1:03:50.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fs14}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.98,1:03:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个游戏\N{\fs14}It's that game where...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.99,1:03:55.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起玩…\N{\fs14}It's the game...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.41,1:03:59.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的游戏\N{\fs14}We're all players.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.25,1:04:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩游戏必须守规矩\N{\fs14}It's all organized. The game is...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.04,1:04:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男人一边  女人一边\N{\fs14}the men are over here, the women are over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.05,1:04:09.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有军人  他们主持游戏\N{\fs14}Then there's the soldiers. They give us our schedule.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.17,1:04:12.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很严厉  没那么简单的\N{\fs14}It's hard, you know. It's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.97,1:04:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁一犯错  谁就要回家去\N{\fs14}lf somebody makes a mistake, they get sent right home.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.81,1:04:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说  你要很小心\N{\fs14}That means you have to be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.98,1:04:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你赢  你就得到奖品\N{\fs14}But if you win, you get first prize!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.52,1:04:24.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么奖\N{\fs14}What's the prize?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.73,1:04:26.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头奖\N{\fs14}First prize!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.45,1:04:31.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-坦克  -我已经有一辆了\N{\fs14}- It's a tank. - I already have one.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.37,1:04:33.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是辆真正的坦克\N{\fs14}This one's a real tank!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.00,1:04:35.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪闪新\N{\fs14}Brand new!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.33,1:04:37.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的坦克\N{\fs14}Real?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.63,1:04:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的  我本来不想告诉你\N{\fs14}Yes! I didn't want to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.68,1:04:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叔叔去哪里了\N{\fs14}Where's Uncle Eliseo going?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.81,1:04:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他属于另一组  大家分成组\N{\fs14}He's on another team. It's all organized.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.60,1:04:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见  叔叔\N{\fs14}Bye, Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.32,1:04:59.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正的坦克\N{\fs14}A real tank.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.92,1:05:15.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  没有骗你吧\N{\fs14}What did l tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.84,1:05:18.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顶瓜瓜\N{\fs14}Fabulous!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.55,1:05:19.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,环境一流\N{\fs14}What a place!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.93,1:05:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  别让人霸占我们的地方\N{\fs14}Hurry up or they'll steal our places. 
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.56,1:05:24.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们订了床位  两张单人床\N{\fs14}We've got a reservation. Two singles!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.27,1:05:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借一借\N{\fs14}Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.19,1:05:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们的\N{\fs14}There's our place!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.45,1:05:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们睡在一起\N{\fs14}This is our bed. We'll sleep real close.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.70,1:05:43.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里又脏又臭  我要到妈妈那里\N{\fs14}It's ugly here. It smells. I want to be with Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.12,1:05:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会的\N{\fs14}We will be!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.75,1:05:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肚子饿\N{\fs14}I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.92,1:05:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会有东西吃的\N{\fs14}We'll eat!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.63,1:05:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都很凶  呼呼喝喝的\N{\fs14}Plus they're really mean here! They yell!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.84,1:05:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不得不凶  人人都在争头奖\N{\fs14}They yell because everybody wants first prize. They have to be tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.47,1:05:58.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么时候才能看到妈妈\N{\fs14}Can l see Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.35,1:06:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏玩完就能了\N{\fs14}When the game's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.02,1:06:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏什么时候玩完\N{\fs14}When's it over?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.27,1:06:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要得到一千分\N{\fs14}You have to get a thousand points.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.20,1:06:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁得到一千分  谁就有坦克\N{\fs14}Whoever gets a thousand points wins a tank.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.82,1:06:13.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信  我们有点心吃吗\N{\fs14}I don't believe you. Are we getting a snack?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.87,1:06:15.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,点心\N{\fs14}A snack?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.79,1:06:18.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去问问  这里都是熟人\N{\fs14}Just ask. We're all friends here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.04,1:06:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-看看谁来了  他叫什么  - Bartolomeo\N{\fs14}- Look who's here. What's his name? - Bartolomeo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.30,1:06:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问你点事儿\N{\fs14}Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.26,1:06:27.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个派果酱面包的人来了没有\N{\fs14}Did the guy who hands out the bread and jam already come by?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.97,1:06:32.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真倒霉  我们刚刚错过了\N{\fs14}Darn it all! We missed him by a second!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.64,1:06:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他会再来  对不对\N{\fs14}He'll come back again though, won't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.27,1:06:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会再来\N{\fs14}He's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.16,1:06:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在说什么?\N{\fs14}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.33,1:06:48.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他问谁懂德语\N{\fs14}He asked if anyone speaks German.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.45,1:06:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要解释营中规矩\N{\fs14}He's going to explain the camp's rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.96,1:06:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你懂德语吗  -不懂\N{\fs14}- Do you speak German? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.85,1:07:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既来之则安之  游戏开始吧\N{\fs14}The game starts now. Whoever's here is here, whoever's not is not.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.52,1:07:14.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先得一千分就胜出\N{\fs14}The first one to get a thousand points wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.90,1:07:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奖品是辆真坦克\N{\fs14}The prize is a tank!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.78,1:07:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个幸运儿\N{\fs14}Lucky him!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.50,1:07:30.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天播音宣布谁领先\N{\fs14}Every day we'll announce who's in the lead from that loudspeaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.96,1:07:33.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得最少分的人要在背后...\N{\fs14}The one with the least points has to wear a sign saying "jackass"...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.01,1:07:35.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吊上个"蠢材"招牌\N{\fs14}right here on his back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.89,1:07:45.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们士兵扮坏蛋  又呼又喝\N{\fs14}We play the part of the real mean guys who yell.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.07,1:07:48.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁害怕  谁得的分就少\N{\fs14}Whoever's scared loses points.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.71,1:08:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在三个情况下  你们分数全失\N{\fs14}You'll lose your points for three things.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.46,1:08:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一  哭\N{\fs14}One, if you cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.18,1:08:11.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二  要找妈妈\N{\fs14}Two, if you want to see your mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.01,1:08:15.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三  肚饿要吃点心\N{\fs14}Three, if you're hungry and you want a snack.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.73,1:08:17.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要妄想\N{\fs14}Forget about it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.07,1:08:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肚饿很容易丢分\N{\fs14}It's easy to lose points for being hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.74,1:08:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天我丢了40分...\N{\fs14}Just yesterday l lost 40 points...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.83,1:08:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我一定要吃果酱面包\N{\fs14}because l absolutely had to have a jam sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.25,1:08:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杏酱面包\N{\fs14}Apricot jam!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.09,1:08:39.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要草莓酱的\N{\fs14}He wanted strawberry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.26,1:08:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,棒棒糖你们不会有得吃\N{\fs14}Don't ask for any lollipops. You won't get any.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.27,1:08:50.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,统统给我们吃\N{\fs14}We eat them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.81,1:08:54.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我昨天就吃掉20个\N{\fs14}I ate 20 of them yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.82,1:08:57.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃到我肚子痛\N{\fs14}What a stomachache.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.11,1:08:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但确实美味\N{\fs14}But they sure were good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.32,1:09:01.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还用说吗\N{\fs14}You bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.21,1:09:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得太快了真抱歉  因为在玩捉迷藏\N{\fs14}Sorry if I'm going so fast, but I'm playing hide and seek.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.01,1:09:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了  否则就被抓到了\N{\fs14}I have to go now or they'll find me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.85,1:09:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有问题  问Bartolomeo  他通天晓地\N{\fs14}Don't ask me anything. Ask Bartolomeo. He knows everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.78,1:09:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说什么  别忘记告诉我\N{\fs14}Don't forget to tell me what he said too.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.65,1:09:33.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一千分吗\N{\fs14}A thousand points?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.78,1:09:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没骗你吧  真的好玩\N{\fs14}I told you we're going to have fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.49,1:09:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人有病\N{\fs14}These guys are crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.45,1:09:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁砧百公斤重  这里三千度热\N{\fs14}This has to weigh a hundred kilos! It's got to be 3,000 degrees in here!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.29,1:09:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Vittorino  我捱不住\N{\fs14}Vittorino, I can't cope anymore!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.00,1:09:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-搬一个就捱不住了  -还要搬啊\N{\fs14}- After only the first one? - Why, are there more to move?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.05,1:09:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要搬  搬到今晚\N{\fs14}We're here until tonight!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.55,1:09:53.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Bartolomeo  他们带你去哪里?\N{\fs14}Bartolomeo, what happened? Where are they taking you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.81,1:09:55.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去医院  我胳膊受伤了\N{\fs14}To the hospital. l hurt my arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.85,1:09:59.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们死定了\N{\fs14}We're going to die here!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.15,1:10:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我捱不住了  我要把它放下\N{\fs14}I can't take it anymore! I'm putting this down.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.03,1:10:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不做  他们会怎样\N{\fs14}I'll tell them I can't do it. What can they do to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.20,1:10:09.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会杀掉你\N{\fs14}They'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.12,1:10:13.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-搬去哪里  -下面\N{\fs14}- Where does this thing go? - Down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.96,1:10:16.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惨了  我死定了\N{\fs14}Good Lord! I'll never make it!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.18,1:10:27.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里肯定有一万度\N{\fs14}It's got to be 1 0,000 degrees in here!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.47,1:10:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fs14}Pop!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.45,1:11:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  我的制服不错吧\N{\fs14}Look here! See? It's nice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.95,1:11:21.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们参加了\N{\fs14}We're signed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.46,1:11:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我报名的时候\N{\fs14}When I got there to sign up...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.13,1:11:27.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公证说...\N{\fs14}the referee was there and he said...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.75,1:11:29.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名单上没有你两父子的名字\N{\fs14}"No, you and your son aren't on the list.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.84,1:11:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有交报名费\N{\fs14}You didn't pay your dues."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.64,1:11:35.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气得我差点晕过去\N{\fs14}I almost fell over.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.76,1:11:39.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说  你们回家吧  我说  你才回去呢\N{\fs14}He said, "You can go home." l said, "No, you go home!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.69,1:11:40.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Joshua和我报了名\N{\fs14}"Joshua and l signed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.58,1:11:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿号码来\N{\fs14}Give me my number!"
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.96,1:11:46.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是给了我一个号码\N{\fs14}In fact, they gave me one. Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.28,1:11:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫他们印在胳膊上  万无一失\N{\fs14}I had them put it here, too, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.12,1:11:53.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  你爸爸...\N{\fs14}See what a nice place...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.45,1:11:56.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带了你去一个顶瓜瓜的地方\N{\fs14}your pop takes you to?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.17,1:12:00.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有和其他孩子玩\N{\fs14}Did you play with the other kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.96,1:12:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有  但他们不懂规矩\N{\fs14}Yes, but they don't know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.97,1:12:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说头奖不是坦克\N{\fs14}They said it isn't true that first prize is a tank.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.51,1:12:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不懂得计分\N{\fs14}They don't know anything about the points.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.18,1:12:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要相信他们  他们狡猾着呢\N{\fs14}Did you fall for that? They're as sly as foxes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.44,1:12:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想赢你  你不要相信\N{\fs14}They want to beat you! Are you joking?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.81,1:12:18.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有坦克  怎么可能\N{\fs14}There's no tank? Don't you believe them!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.36,1:12:21.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们今天得到几分\N{\fs14}How many points did we get today?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.12,1:12:23.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,50\N{\fs14}Fifty.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.28,1:12:27.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,48  他们扣了我两分\N{\fs14}Forty-eight. They took two points away from me because...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.54,1:12:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我跳房子的时候...\N{\fs14}I tripped while l was...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.71,1:12:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拌倒了\N{\fs14}playing hopscotch.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.96,1:12:37.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们今天玩得好开心\N{\fs14}We laughed like crazy today! l died laughing!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.13,1:12:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认真过把瘾\N{\fs14}Boy, did l have fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.09,1:12:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴不得明天立即来到\N{\fs14}I can't wait to start all over again tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.26,1:12:45.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以玩跳房子  拔河\N{\fs14}Hopscotch, tug of war…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.56,1:12:47.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和团团转\N{\fs14}and ring around the rosy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.44,1:12:50.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏花款样多多  多到我想不起来\N{\fs14}Every game. I don't even remember all of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.61,1:12:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  你们玩得太疯  累死我了\N{\fs14}"You guys are obsessed! Stop! I'm tired!" I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.95,1:12:53.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fs14}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.82,1:12:56.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有吃过东西\N{\fs14}Did you eat something?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.78,1:12:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有  但我没要点心\N{\fs14}Yes, but l didn't ask for a snack.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.49,1:13:02.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖孩子  就是说你也得到了12分\N{\fs14}Good boy! That means you got 12 points too!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.16,1:13:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我48  你12\N{\fs14}Forty-eight for me, twelve for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.21,1:13:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一共60分\N{\fs14}Sixty points.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.75,1:13:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,60分你有奖\N{\fs14}This is what you get when you get up to 60.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.01,1:13:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是面包  没有果酱\N{\fs14}A plain piece of bread, no jam.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.68,1:13:15.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃吧\N{\fs14}Here, eat this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.52,1:13:21.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-60分多不多  -还用问吗\N{\fs14}- Is 60 points a lot? - Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.85,1:13:23.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然多\N{\fs14}It sure is!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.28,1:13:29.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看谁来了  Bartolomeo\N{\fs14}Look who's here! Bartolomeo!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.20,1:13:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况怎样\N{\fs14}How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.32,1:13:34.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差点没命  我领了20\N{\fs14}Any worse than this; l got 20 of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.00,1:13:41.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们比他分高\N{\fs14}We got more than him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.75,1:13:44.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们领先呢  别告诉他\N{\fs14}Don't tell him that. We're in the lead!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.81,1:13:56.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过  小孩  老妪不准出来\N{\fs14}I already told you: no children or old ladies!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.77,1:13:58.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去  你不是劳动分子\N{\fs14}Back inside! You don't work!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.11,1:14:01.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人  下楼去\N{\fs14}The rest, downstairs!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.74,1:14:05.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走吧  孩子们  这边去\N{\fs14}Let's go, girls, quickly. Come on. This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.87,1:14:09.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女兵一来就发狠\N{\fs14}That one's new. She learned right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.70,1:14:12.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门口那女兵  初来时相当好相处\N{\fs14}The lady at the door, she seemed nice when she first came.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.25,1:14:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在变得最凶\N{\fs14}She's the worst of all!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.09,1:14:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起码她不派老妇和小孩去劳动\N{\fs14}At least she didn't send the old ladies and children to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.09,1:14:21.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老妇和小孩不用劳动  但要死\N{\fs14}They don't send old people and kids to work because they kill them!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.64,1:14:24.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们被派去洗澡\N{\fs14}One of these days they'll call them to take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.60,1:14:26.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小朋友  洗澡啦\N{\fs14}"Children, shower time!"
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.47,1:14:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  去的是毒气室\N{\fs14}The truth is, they make them shower there in the gas chamber.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.95,1:14:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下楼\N{\fs14}Downstairs!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.08,1:14:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎捱得下去?\N{\fs14}How can l do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.21,1:14:46.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Vittorino\N{\fs14}Vittorino!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.25,1:14:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些铁砧从哪里来\N{\fs14}Where'd they find all these anvils?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.51,1:14:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fs14}Pop!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.22,1:14:57.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来干什么  你不应该来\N{\fs14}Why are you here? You're not supposed to be here!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.14,1:14:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开\N{\fs14}Go away!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.64,1:15:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不跟其他孩子一起呢\N{\fs14}Why aren't you with the other kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.02,1:15:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说...\N{\fs14}They said...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.19,1:15:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小孩今天都要洗澡  我不想洗\N{\fs14}all us kids have to take a shower today, and l don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.07,1:15:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洗澡去吧\N{\fs14}Go take a shower!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.82,1:15:10.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不去\N{\fs14}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.82,1:15:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就不去\N{\fs14}I'm not going to.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.78,1:15:15.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我洗澡去\N{\fs14}Go take a shower!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.29,1:15:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里干什么\N{\fs14}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.87,1:15:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在制造...\N{\fs14}We're making...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.29,1:15:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦克\N{\fs14}a tank.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.01,1:15:28.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正在制造  还没有造完坦克的轮带\N{\fs14}We're building the tank. We're still working on the tracks.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.13,1:15:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做得太慢\N{\fs14}We're running slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.97,1:15:34.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不可以留在这里  去洗澡\N{\fs14}You can't stay here. Go take your shower!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.14,1:15:37.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想洗\N{\fs14}I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.27,1:15:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小顽固  我会告诉你妈  扣你10分\N{\fs14}You stubborn thing! I'll tell Mom! Ten points off for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.15,1:15:45.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里躲着  我下班  一同走\N{\fs14}Hide behind there. We'll go back together when I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.66,1:15:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让别人看到你\N{\fs14}Don't let anyone see you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.62,1:15:49.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次可真够瞧的了\N{\fs14}This sure is fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.39,1:16:04.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都脱光了\N{\fs14}Everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.51,1:16:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都脱光了  衣服挂在那儿\N{\fs14}Take everything off! Hang it up there!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.60,1:16:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洗完澡可以拿回去\N{\fs14}You'll get it back after the shower.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.73,1:16:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向前走\N{\fs14}Forward!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.02,1:16:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记住自己的号码  方便认回衣服\N{\fs14}Remember your number to get your clothes back!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.20,1:16:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妇女小孩一同洗澡\N{\fs14}Women and children will shower together.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.91,1:16:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有跌伤\N{\fs14}Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.05,1:16:37.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  Βartolomeo\N{\fs14}Thanks, Βartolomeo.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.34,1:16:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后你要整天躲在这里\N{\fs14}From now on, you have to hide here the whole day.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.18,1:16:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被他们发现  我们就丧失资格啦\N{\fs14}If they see us now it's over. We're disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.19,1:16:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要做什么\N{\fs14}What do I have to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.69,1:16:47.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要留在这里  Vittorino  帮帮忙\N{\fs14}You have to stay. Vittorino, help me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.07,1:16:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要整天躲在这里\N{\fs14}You have to hide here all day.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.40,1:16:53.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让人见到  尤其呼喝的人\N{\fs14}Don't let anyone see you, especially those mean guys who yell.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.62,1:16:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记着\N{\fs14}Remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.95,1:16:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲起来\N{\fs14}Stay hidden!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.16,1:17:00.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是游戏最难的部分了  如果玩得对...\N{\fs14}This is the hardest part. If we get this right,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.00,1:17:05.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天得120分  一定赢到坦克\N{\fs14}the tank is ours. It's worth 120 points a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.71,1:17:08.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会带你走  我会藏着你  大家都以为你失踪了\N{\fs14}I'll take you with me. I'll hide you. You're gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.84,1:17:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前谁见过你  你是谁  他在哪儿\N{\fs14}Who's ever seen you before? Who are you? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.72,1:17:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗\N{\fs14}Got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.39,1:17:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了\N{\fs14}Got ya!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.52,1:17:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖孩子\N{\fs14}Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.49,1:18:41.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有人  我有没有打扰到你们\N{\fs14}Anybody here? Am l disturbing?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.26,1:18:52.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fs14}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.76,1:18:54.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要尽快\N{\fs14}Quick as lightning!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.77,1:19:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安  公主\N{\fs14}Good morning, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.81,1:19:04.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚...\N{\fs14}Last night,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.11,1:19:06.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我整晚梦到你\N{\fs14}I dreamt about you all night!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.99,1:19:10.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去看电影\N{\fs14}We were going to the movies.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.82,1:19:12.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你穿着我喜欢的那套粉红套装\N{\fs14}You were wearing that pink suit that I really like.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.66,1:19:14.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我脑中只有你  公主\N{\fs14}You're all I think about, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.12,1:19:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惦念的只是你\N{\fs14}I always think about you. And now...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.96,1:19:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fs14}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.34,1:19:23.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸用轮车推我  但他不会推\N{\fs14}Pop wheels me in the wheelbarrow, but he doesn't know how to drive!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.55,1:19:25.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑到我肚子痛\N{\fs14}We laugh like crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.93,1:19:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们领先呢  今天有得了多少分\N{\fs14}We're in the lead! How many points do we have today?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.10,1:19:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑  呼喝的坏蛋在我们后面\N{\fs14}Run! The mean guys who yell are behind us!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.18,1:19:35.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-哪里  -这里\N{\fs14}- Where? - Over here! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.12,1:19:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,衣服干了没有\N{\fs14}Are they dry?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.62,1:19:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干了\N{\fs14}They're dry.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.17,1:19:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接住\N{\fs14}Catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.13,1:19:57.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿上去\N{\fs14}Get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.82,1:20:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Vittorino  Alfonso等人呢\N{\fs14}What happened to Vittorino, Alfonso and the others?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.49,1:20:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们活不成了\N{\fs14}They didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.18,1:21:12.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一提起我  我就消失\N{\fs14}"If you say my name, I'm not there anymore."
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.85,1:21:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉默\N{\fs14}Silence.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.02,1:21:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地  吓死我了  什么事\N{\fs14}Thank goodness. I was getting scared. What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.36,1:21:53.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们快疯了\N{\fs14}They're half crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.53,1:21:58.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,替我检查那军医...\N{\fs14}The man who does the check-ups, the Captain;
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.41,1:22:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的朋友  我做侍者时认识\N{\fs14}he's a friend of mine. l met him when l was a waiter.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.95,1:22:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说  高官们和他们的妻子会举行晚宴\N{\fs14}He said they're having a dinner with all the officials and their wives.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.21,1:22:08.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问我想不想去捧盘\N{\fs14}He asked me if I wanted to wait tables at the dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.17,1:22:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他或者有办法送我们出去\N{\fs14}Maybe he wants to help me. He might get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.01,1:22:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到Joshua了吗\N{\fs14}Have you seen Joshua?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.48,1:22:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  什么意思\N{\fs14}What do you mean, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.49,1:22:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么  过来\N{\fs14}What are you doing? Come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.87,1:22:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.53,1:22:36.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫你过来呢\N{\fs14}l told you to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.20,1:22:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  出来啊\N{\fs14}No? Come on out!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.92,1:22:42.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  你全身都弄脏了\N{\fs14}Come out! Look here. You're all dirty.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.42,1:22:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去了哪里\N{\fs14}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.05,1:22:48.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才在打纸牌\N{\fs14}I had to finish playing rummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.55,1:22:52.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们用我们做扣子  制肥皂\N{\fs14}They make buttons and soap out of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.98,1:22:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fs14}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.35,1:22:58.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把我们送入火炉烧死\N{\fs14}They burn us all in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.52,1:23:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁告诉你的\N{\fs14}Who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.65,1:23:03.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个人一边哭一边说...\N{\fs14}A man was crying. 
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.28,1:23:06.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们用我们做扣子  制肥皂\N{\fs14}He said they make buttons and soap out of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.03,1:23:11.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你信了吗\N{\fs14}You fell for that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.62,1:23:12.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又信了\N{\fs14}Again?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.04,1:23:16.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你是个精乖的小孩\N{\fs14}I thought you were a sharp boy; cunning, intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.34,1:23:20.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用人来做扣子  制肥皂  怎可能\N{\fs14}Buttons and soap out of people? That'll be the day!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.55,1:23:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你却相信\N{\fs14}You believed that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.97,1:23:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想看  我用Bartolomeo变的肥皂洗手…\N{\fs14}Just imagine. Tomorrow morning, l wash my hands with Bartolomeo...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.02,1:23:30.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好用\N{\fs14}a good scrub.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.64,1:23:32.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  扣Francesco变的扣子吗\N{\fs14}Then I'll button up with Francesco.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.52,1:23:33.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有可能  你说\N{\fs14}Darn it all!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.73,1:23:36.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Giorgio不见了\N{\fs14}Look! l just lost Giorgio!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.03,1:23:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这颗纽扣像他吗\N{\fs14}Does this look like a person?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.45,1:23:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们戏弄你  你却信以为真\N{\fs14}Come on! They were teasing you! And you fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.95,1:23:45.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还说了什么\N{\fs14}What else did they tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.37,1:23:47.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说我们会被送入火炉\N{\fs14}That we get cooked in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.25,1:23:53.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活活烧死\N{\fs14}They burn us up in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.51,1:24:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也信了  他们说你就信吗\N{\fs14}You fell for that too! You just eat everything up!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.18,1:24:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听过用柴当燃料\N{\fs14}I've heard of a wood oven...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.52,1:24:05.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没听过用人当燃料\N{\fs14}but I've never seen a man oven before.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.44,1:24:08.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是木头做的  抓这个律师去烧吧\N{\fs14}"I'm made of wood!" "Take this lawyer!"
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.77,1:24:11.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,律师太湿  烧不着\N{\fs14}"This lawyer doesn't burn. He's not dry enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.95,1:24:13.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会冒烟\N{\fs14}Look at that smoke!"
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.37,1:24:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钮扣  肥皂  烧人\N{\fs14}Buttons, soap, we get burned in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.99,1:24:19.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑了\N{\fs14}Let's be serious now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.25,1:24:23.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明天还要玩布袋竞赛呢\N{\fs14}I have a bag race with the bad guys tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.46,1:24:25.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不玩了  要回家去\N{\fs14}That's enough. I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.38,1:24:29.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在回去吗\N{\fs14}Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.80,1:24:30.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在回去\N{\fs14}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.30,1:24:34.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在下着雨  你会淋出病的\N{\fs14}It's raining now. You'll come down with a terrible fever!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.72,1:24:36.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管  现在就走\N{\fs14}I don't care. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.60,1:24:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  你非要走的话...\N{\fs14}All right. If you want to go...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.02,1:24:43.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走  收拾行李\N{\fs14}I'll get our stuff and we'll leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.57,1:24:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以走\N{\fs14}We can leave?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.03,1:24:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  他们可以逼人留下吗\N{\fs14}Naturally. What do you think they do, force people to stay here?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.91,1:24:51.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好难\N{\fs14}That'll be the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.79,1:24:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,异想天开  我们说走就走\N{\fs14}Wouldn't that be great? Let's go. We'll pack our bags...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.75,1:24:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收拾好行李就走\N{\fs14}and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.63,1:24:59.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜  我们在领先  却弃权\N{\fs14}What a shame. We were in the lead. We're quitting. Off the list we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.51,1:25:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那辆真坦克会被其他孩子赢去\N{\fs14}Some other kid will win the real tank.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.97,1:25:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没有其他孩子了  我是唯一的一个\N{\fs14}There aren't any other kids. I'm the only one left.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.56,1:25:10.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没有孩子了吗  这里多着呢\N{\fs14}There aren't any more kids? It's chock-full of them here!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.06,1:25:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里\N{\fs14}Where are they then?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.94,1:25:15.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都在躲着  绝不露面\N{\fs14}They're all hiding. Nobody's supposed to see them.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.94,1:25:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-都在认真玩游戏  -我不明白\N{\fs14}- This is a serious game! – I just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.57,1:25:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们拿到了多少分\N{\fs14}How many points do we have?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.53,1:25:23.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多687分\N{\fs14}Almost 687.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.99,1:25:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉过你一千次了\N{\fs14}I told you a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.75,1:25:28.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  既然要走就走吧\N{\fs14}Let's go, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.29,1:25:30.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们本来会赢的...  -我们会赢吗\N{\fs14}- We're winning, but if you want - We're winning?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.29,1:25:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在领先  早已经告诉你\N{\fs14}We're first, l told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.92,1:25:36.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你要退出  只好退出\N{\fs14}But we'll quit if you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.47,1:25:39.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我昨天才看过积分表\N{\fs14}I saw the chart yesterday. We'll go anyway, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.80,1:25:41.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜  Bartolomeo  我和Joshua要走了\N{\fs14}Bye, Bartolomeo. Joshua and I are leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.97,1:25:43.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们讨厌这地方\N{\fs14}We're fed up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.64,1:25:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦克已经造成\N{\fs14}The tank is done. It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.94,1:25:50.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抹干净火嘴再开车\N{\fs14}Clean the spark plugs off before you start it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.15,1:25:53.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得要拉开油门\N{\fs14}Open the throttle...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.03,1:25:57.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则大炮会卡住轮带\N{\fs14}otherwise the cannon will get stuck with the tracks.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.70,1:25:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有那支机枪  多么精致\N{\fs14}And the gun. Did you see how nice it is? It came out beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.16,1:26:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开车前记得松刹闸\N{\fs14}Lift the emergency brake off before you move!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.21,1:26:05.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和他要走了\N{\fs14}We're going.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.17,1:26:07.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Joshua要退出\N{\fs14}Joshua wants to quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.88,1:26:08.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来要开着坦克走的\N{\fs14}We could have gone back with a tank soon,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.16,1:26:10.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在却要坐巴士\N{\fs14}but we'll take the bus today.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.84,1:26:13.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和Joshua要走了  大家再见\N{\fs14}Joshua and l are leaving. So long, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.80,1:26:15.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们讨厌这地方\N{\fs14}We're tired of this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.14,1:26:18.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  否则赶不上巴士了\N{\fs14}Let's go or we'll miss the bus.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.82,1:26:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  Joshua\N{\fs14}Let's go, Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.86,1:26:31.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怕被雨淋湿  发高烧\N{\fs14}It's raining. I'll come down with a terrible fever!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.08,1:27:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我  爸爸呀\N{\fs14}It's me, Pop!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.79,1:27:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有重要的话跟你说\N{\fs14}I have to tell you something important! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.75,1:27:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小鬼头今早一直躲避我\N{\fs14}That little rascal's been running away all morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.34,1:27:54.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真的有小孩  -二千个\N{\fs14}- Is there really a kid? - There must be two thousand!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.30,1:27:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们像小老鼠  到处躲\N{\fs14}They're like mice. They hide all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.51,1:27:58.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都想得到我们的坦克  停\N{\fs14}Those creeps want our tank! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.52,1:28:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一等\N{\fs14}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.69,1:28:04.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我似乎见过他\N{\fs14}I might have spotted him.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.48,1:28:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可能在附近\N{\fs14}I think he's nearby.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.65,1:28:11.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如你去查一查  我在这里等\N{\fs14}Look. Go see if he's hiding in there. I'll wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.36,1:28:12.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,替你把风\N{\fs14}I'll keep a watch out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.96,1:28:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在那里  爸爸\N{\fs14}He's there, Pop!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.29,1:28:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么样子的  金发吗  -嗯\N{\fs14}- What'd he look like? Blond? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.09,1:28:26.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是他  他叫Schwanz\N{\fs14}That's him then. His name is... Schwanz.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.59,1:28:28.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲在里面已经三个星期了\N{\fs14}He's been in there for three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.01,1:28:31.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他排第二  但我们领先\N{\fs14}He was the runner up. We beat him, though!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.64,1:28:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迟早我会找到其他的孩子\N{\fs14}Sooner or later, I'll find the others too.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.56,1:28:36.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有多少个  -密密麻麻\N{\fs14}- How many are there? - It's swarming, l told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.27,1:28:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都躲着\N{\fs14}They're all hidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.45,1:28:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸  看呀\N{\fs14}Look, Pop!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.12,1:28:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个匿藏点\N{\fs14}There's a hideout!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.96,1:28:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  你  你  取消资格  我们走\N{\fs14}Got ya, got ya, got ya! You're out! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.80,1:29:04.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠  她看见我们了\N{\fs14}Holy smokes! She saw us!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.72,1:29:06.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们被淘汰了吗\N{\fs14}Are we out?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.77,1:29:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她过来是因为她看见了你\N{\fs14}She's coming over for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.85,1:29:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在玩沉默游戏\N{\fs14}Now it's time for the "be quiet" game.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.36,1:29:13.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对不要吱声\N{\fs14}You're never to speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.82,1:29:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发誓\N{\fs14}Swear it!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.61,1:29:18.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-发誓啊  -我发誓\N{\fs14}- Swear it! – I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.70,1:29:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们咕噜咕噜  你反正听不懂\N{\fs14}They all talk strange. You can't understand a word.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.50,1:29:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们过得这关  头奖就是我们的了\N{\fs14}If we get through this, the first prize is ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.33,1:29:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有领先的人  都要玩沉默游戏\N{\fs14}They're rounding up everyone in first place. It's the silence game.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.46,1:29:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一声都不能出  知道吗\N{\fs14}Not a word, got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.35,1:29:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么跟小孩在这里\N{\fs14}Why are you here with the children?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.14,1:29:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准你和孩子交谈\N{\fs14}Quiet! You're never to speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.94,1:29:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓不会\N{\fs14}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.09,1:30:44.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有话对你说  很重要\N{\fs14}I have to talk to you. Very important.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.05,1:30:47.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-哪里  几时  -我会打暗号  过会儿\N{\fs14}- Where? When? – I'll signal you. Later.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.49,1:31:02.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.80,1:31:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫过你别跟小孩说话\N{\fs14}I told you not to talk to the children.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.63,1:32:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生  内子也在这里\N{\fs14}Doctor, my wife is here too.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.91,1:32:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢吃\N{\fs14}Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.95,1:32:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃得太快不好\N{\fs14}Eat slowly. It's bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.91,1:32:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们领先  可能早走\N{\fs14}We're in the lead. We just might leave early.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.34,1:32:54.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏提早结束\N{\fs14}The game finishes early.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.55,1:32:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要分外小心  不要出错\N{\fs14}Don't make a mistake now that we're in the lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.64,1:32:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢吃\N{\fs14}Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.41,1:33:24.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留心听这个谜\N{\fs14}So. Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.88,1:33:32.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肥肥丑丑\N{\fs14}"Fat, fat, ugly, ugly,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.76,1:33:33.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胆小到发黄\N{\fs14}all yellow in reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.68,1:33:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你问我  我是什么家伙\N{\fs14}If you ask me what I am...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.06,1:33:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会答  贱贱贱\N{\fs14}I answer, 'Cheep, cheep, cheep.'
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.36,1:33:49.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一面走路  一面拉弓\N{\fs14}Walking along l go, 'Poopoo'.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.74,1:33:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底是谁\N{\fs14}Who am I? Tell me true."
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.79,1:33:58.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鸭  对吗\N{\fs14}A duckling, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.96,1:34:03.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是小鸭\N{\fs14}Is it a duckling?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.26,1:34:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fs14}It's not!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.06,1:34:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在维也纳的时候爸爸的一个兽医朋友出的这个谜面\N{\fs14}A veterinarian friend of mine sent it to me from Vienna.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.43,1:34:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜不出来\N{\fs14}I can't send him mine...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.90,1:34:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不能还他一个谜面\N{\fs14}until I solve this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.90,1:34:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为是...\N{\fs14}I thought...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.65,1:34:22.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸭嘴兽\N{\fs14}duck-billed platypus...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.07,1:34:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但鸭嘴兽不叫  贱贱贱\N{\fs14}but it doesn't go, "Cheep, cheep, cheep."
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.95,1:34:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸭嘴兽叫...\N{\fs14}A duck-billed platypus goes...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.34,1:34:36.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚我替你翻译成意大利话\N{\fs14}I translated it into Italian for you last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.84,1:34:41.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为怎样\N{\fs14}Well, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.01,1:34:44.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了小鸭  我想不出什么\N{\fs14}Everything points to a duckling.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.73,1:34:49.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮忙\N{\fs14}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.19,1:34:55.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你\N{\fs14}For heaven's sake...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.53,1:34:56.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮忙\N{\fs14}help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.91,1:35:00.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我连睡也睡不着\N{\fs14}I can't even sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.14,1:35:18.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谜底是小鸭\N{\fs14}It's the duckling!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.57,1:37:47.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fs14}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.78,1:37:52.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我好累  -过来\N{\fs14}- I'm tired. - Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.34,1:37:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在哪里\N{\fs14}Where are we here?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.51,1:38:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可能走错了路\N{\fs14}I might have taken the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.59,1:38:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖孩子  睡吧  做个美梦\N{\fs14}Good boy, sleep. Dream sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.89,1:38:07.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能现在就是个梦\N{\fs14}Maybe it's only a dream!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.18,1:38:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在做梦  Joshua\N{\fs14}We're dreaming, Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.31,1:38:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明早  妈妈会摇醒我们\N{\fs14}Tomorrow morning, Mommy will come wake us up...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.27,1:38:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,端来牛奶  饼干\N{\fs14}and bring us two nice cups of milk and cookies.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.57,1:38:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先吃\N{\fs14}First, we'll eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.53,1:38:22.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我跟她做两三次爱\N{\fs14}Then I'll make love to her two or three times...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.03,1:38:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我还有气力\N{\fs14}if I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.85,1:39:15.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  Bartolomeo\N{\fs14}Excuse me, Bartolomeo.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.68,1:39:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有两军官没有报到  我觉得他们溜掉了\N{\fs14}They've called those two officers 20 times. l bet they escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.73,1:39:21.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还听懂什么\N{\fs14}Did you understand anything else?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.19,1:39:23.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使猜也猜得七七八八\N{\fs14}It's clear enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.28,1:39:26.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快打完仗  纳粹党树倒猢狲散\N{\fs14}The war is over. They're running all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.36,1:39:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,货车要开到哪里\N{\fs14}Where are those trucks going?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.49,1:39:31.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最要紧的是别坐上去\N{\fs14}The important thing is not to get on those trucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.49,1:39:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满车去  空车回\N{\fs14}They leave full and come back empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.41,1:39:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道车子开到哪里吗\N{\fs14}You know where they're going?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.33,1:39:40.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人呢  她们怎么了\N{\fs14}What about the women? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.50,1:39:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们离开这地狱吧  各散东西\N{\fs14}Let's get out of this dump and split up.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.63,1:39:45.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连行李也不用收拾\N{\fs14}We don't even have to pack our bags!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.55,1:39:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪声  狗吠  吵了好几个钟头\N{\fs14}I've been hearing only dogs and machine guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.43,1:39:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想毁灭一切\N{\fs14}They want to get rid of everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.52,1:39:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了\N{\fs14}I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.19,1:39:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在Viareggio再见  合作开铁砧厂\N{\fs14}See you in Viareggio. We'll start an anvil factory!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.81,1:39:56.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了  各位  我走了\N{\fs14}So long, guys. I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.88,1:40:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来看吧\N{\fs14}Come see.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.34,1:40:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们多生气  气得在跳\N{\fs14}Look how mad they are! Furious!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.43,1:40:22.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见了吗  都在找你\N{\fs14}You see? They're looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.77,1:40:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样大阵仗  只为了找你\N{\fs14}Just for you. All this is over you!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.10,1:40:27.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是最后一个  只剩下你\N{\fs14}You're the last one! The last one to find!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.65,1:40:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们拼命找  连石头也翻起来\N{\fs14}They're even looking under the rocks!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.73,1:40:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏明早结束  举行颁奖典礼\N{\fs14}The game is over tomorrow. They'll give the award.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.19,1:40:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你躲得过今晚  就得到60分\N{\fs14}If they don't find you tonight, it's worth 60 points!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.66,1:40:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在有几分\N{\fs14}How many points do we have?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.83,1:40:41.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有940分  再加60呢\N{\fs14}We've got 940 points. Plus 60?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.75,1:40:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-一千  -冠军  我们胜出\N{\fs14}- A thousand! - First place! We win!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.62,1:40:46.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们找遍每个角落也找不到你\N{\fs14}They're looking all over for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.00,1:40:49.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚是最后一关  不要出错\N{\fs14}No mistakes tonight. This is it!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.05,1:40:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快躲在箱内   -Schwanz在里面\N{\fs14}- Go hide in that box, quick! - Schwanz is in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.59,1:40:53.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fs14}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.80,1:40:57.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个金发男孩\N{\fs14}The blond boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.18,1:41:01.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们昨天发现他  淘汰了\N{\fs14}They got him yesterday. He was eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.77,1:41:04.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那处最安全  谁也不会再去找\N{\fs14}It's the safest place to hide. Nobody will look.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.65,1:41:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  快走\N{\fs14}Let's go, quick as lightning. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.32,1:41:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去\N{\fs14}Inside!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.49,1:41:14.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带张毯  保暖\N{\fs14}Take this blanket in case you get cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.66,1:41:18.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很快回来\N{\fs14}I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.42,1:41:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我引开他们...  他在那边\N{\fs14}I'll put them on the wrong track. I think I saw him over there!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.46,1:41:53.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸  我被你吓死啦\N{\fs14}Pop, you scared me to death!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.59,1:41:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那张毯给我  你冷吗\N{\fs14}Give me the blanket. Are you cold?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.21,1:41:58.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把外衣也给我\N{\fs14}Give me your sweater then.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.09,1:42:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我扔在树上  引开他们\N{\fs14}I'll throw it on a tree and put them off track.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.05,1:42:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们到处找你\N{\fs14}They're looking all over for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.68,1:42:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都大喊  Joshua呢\N{\fs14}Everybody's yelling, "Where's Joshua?"
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.77,1:42:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破口大骂  来势汹汹\N{\fs14}They're even cursing. They're really, really mad!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.77,1:42:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁也不会找到你  我迟点回来\N{\fs14}No one will find you. Bye, now. I'll be back later.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.24,1:42:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fs14}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.66,1:42:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使我很久才回来\N{\fs14}if I'm really late coming back...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.53,1:42:22.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不要动\N{\fs14}don't you move.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.79,1:42:25.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要出来\N{\fs14}Don't come out. You're not to come out...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.67,1:42:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到一点声  一个人都没有\N{\fs14}until it's completely quiet...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.34,1:42:32.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全至上\N{\fs14}and nobody is in sight, just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.38,1:42:33.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说一遍\N{\fs14}Say it!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.72,1:42:36.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不出来  直到一个人都没有\N{\fs14}I won't come out until nobody is around.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.39,1:42:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖孩子  小顽固\N{\fs14}Good boy, stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.26,1:43:09.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开\N{\fs14}Leave!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.97,1:43:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开  狗\N{\fs14}Go away, dog!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.56,1:43:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开  你这只狗\N{\fs14}Go, dog!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.27,1:43:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开\N{\fs14}Leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.54,1:43:29.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有你的  Ferruccio\N{\fs14}Good job, Ferruccio.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.54,1:43:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的办法真奏效!\N{\fs14}It works.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.74,1:43:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有没有人叫Dora的\N{\fs14}Is there anyone called Dora here?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.29,1:44:41.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Dora  你在吗  是我呀\N{\fs14}Dora, are you here? It's Guido.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.29,1:44:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有人躲着  Dora在吗\N{\fs14}I know someone is hiding here. Is there a Dora here?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.98,1:44:58.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Dora在吗  意大利人  我的太太\N{\fs14}Is there a Dora here? She's Italian. She's my wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.02,1:45:00.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有  这里有个Dora\N{\fs14}Yes, there's a Dora here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.73,1:45:03.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Dora  是我啊\N{\fs14}It's me, Dora!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.49,1:45:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是她  还有没有别的Dora \N{\fs14}It's not her! Is there another Dora?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.03,1:45:10.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们一到外面就跳车\N{\fs14}Jump out of the truck as soon as you can!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.45,1:45:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跳车  逃\N{\fs14}Get off! Jump out!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.68,1:50:32.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的坦克\N{\fs14}It's true!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.78,1:50:44.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小朋友\N{\fs14}Boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.37,1:50:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一个人吗  你叫什么\N{\fs14}You alone? What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.50,1:50:53.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全听不懂我的话吗\N{\fs14}Can't you understand at least a word of mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.96,1:50:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  我载你一程\N{\fs14}Come on, I'll give you a drive!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.96,1:50:57.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上来\N{\fs14}Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.22,1:51:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来...  我抱你\N{\fs14}Here… Let me hug you in.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.91,1:51:53.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fs14}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.67,1:52:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的经历\N{\fs14}This is my story.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.01,1:52:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我父亲所作的牺牲\N{\fs14}This is the sacrifice my father made.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.02,1:52:17.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我父亲赐我的恩典\N{\fs14}This was his gift to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.69,1:52:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们赢了\N{\fs14}We won!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.19,1:52:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我们赢了\N{\fs14}Yes, we won!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.48,1:52:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一千分  好开心啊\N{\fs14}A thousand points to laugh like crazy about!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.36,1:52:29.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得了冠军  坐坦克回家\N{\fs14}We came in first! We're taking the tank home!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.74,1:52:32.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们赢了\N{\fs14}We won!

